  [8636
   :block/title
   "(2) For the purposes of [section 14]([[6ad2f38a-d1c8-49b2-82af-ab396dc19836]])(3)(a), the person must first consider the provi- sions of the following key instruments to the extent that the provisions directly affect the matter:"]
