  [8998 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-8c1b-4037-acf6-119ab349b079"]
  [8999 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [8999 :block/order "c1FC"]
  [8999 :block/page 493]
  [8999 :block/parent 493]
  [8999
   :block/title
   "(3) A consent authority may grant a planning consent on the basis that the activity is classified as a restricted discretionary activity or a discretionary activity regardless of what type of activity the application was expressed to be for."]
  [8999 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [8999 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-74ee-4cfb-8269-386a1054850b"]
  [9001 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9001 :block/order "c1FC"]
  [9001 :block/page 493]
  [9001 :block/parent 9002]
  [9001
   :block/title
   "(a) for a restricted discretionary activity, only for those matters over which a land use plan, proposed land use plan, water services standard, or national rule has reserved discretion:"]
  [9001 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9001 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-7613-4c0e-b527-88b9ded757cd"]
  [9002 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9002 :block/order "c1FB"]
  [9002 :block/page 493]
  [9002 :block/parent 493]
  [9002
   :block/title
   "(2) If it grants a planning consent, the consent authority may impose conditions on the planning consent,—"]
  [9002 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9002 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-b6ff-4480-86e5-4e50b55530ef"]
  [9004 :block/created-at 1792209811583]
  [9004 :block/order "c1Fk"]
  [9004 :block/page 448]
  [9004 :block/parent 448]
  [9004 :block/title ""]
  [9004 :block/updated-at 1792209811583]
  [9004 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-c899-416c-81e9-61df8238b5a7"]
  [9005 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9005 :block/order "c1FN"]
  [9005 :block/page 448]
  [9005 :block/parent 448]
  [9005
   :block/title
   "(4) A consent authority may decide that an adaptive management approach suffi- ciently diminishes the risk and uncertainty if it is satisfied that—"]
  [9005 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9005 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-538f-4e9a-96ee-30d460378fa0"]
  [9006 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9006 :block/order "c1FP"]
  [9006 :block/page 448]
  [9006 :block/parent 9012]
  [9006
   :block/title
   "(a) must allow an activity to commence on a small scale, for a short period, or in stages to allow its effects to be monitored; and"]
  [9006 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9006 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-38b7-4e7d-9cf4-fa22946f5c41"]
  [9007 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9007 :block/order "c1FQ"]
  [9007 :block/page 448]
  [9007 :block/parent 9012]
  [9007 :block/title "(b) must require baseline information for—"]
  [9007 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9007 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-a0fa-4b9c-9126-0df7e18eebbe"]
  [9008 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9008 :block/order "c1Fa"]
  [9008 :block/page 448]
  [9008 :block/parent 9029]
  [9008 :block/title "(ii) adequately manage any remaining risk; and"]
  [9008 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9008 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-560d-4ae1-a8c9-4b1a7559e104"]
  [9010 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9010 :block/order "c1Fc"]
  [9010 :block/page 448]
  [9010 :block/parent 9021]
  [9010
   :block/title
   "(c) the importance of the activity for which the consent relates; and"]
  [9010 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9010 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-3208-475d-85c0-2fcddaa781fc"]
  [9011 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9011 :block/order "c1Fe"]
  [9011 :block/page 448]
  [9011 :block/parent 9021]
  [9011
   :block/title
   "(e) whether, and the extent to which, the adaptive management approach will sufficiently diminish the risk and the uncertainty."]
  [9011 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9011 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-4d7f-4297-936e-2146644492dd"]
  [9012 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9012 :block/order "c1FMG"]
  [9012 :block/page 448]
  [9012 :block/parent 448]
  [9012 :block/title "(2) An adaptive management approach—"]
  [9012 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9012 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-6d0b-49a4-8132-e137de5b1c1b"]
  [9013 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9013 :block/order "c1Fb"]
  [9013 :block/page 448]
  [9013 :block/parent 9021]
  [9013
   :block/title
   "(b) the extent of any environmental risk (including the consequences if the risk is realised); and"]
  [9013 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9013 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-223b-40bc-82f3-8b9c1c919c34"]
  [9015 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9015 :block/order "c1FY"]
  [9015 :block/page 448]
  [9015 :block/parent 9021]
  [9015
   :block/title
   "(a) whether there is adequate evidence that using an adaptive management approach will—"]
  [9015 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9015 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-380d-4a81-ae14-99ce0867c113"]
  [9017 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9017 :block/order "c1Fi"]
  [9017 :block/page 448]
  [9017 :block/parent 9005]
  [9017
   :block/title
   "(c) indicators are set to prompt remedial action before adverse effects occur or reach unacceptable levels; and"]
  [9017 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9017 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-e36a-43e1-93bc-583d80e0b297"]
  [9018 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9018 :block/order "c1Fh"]
  [9018 :block/page 448]
  [9018 :block/parent 9005]
  [9018
   :block/title
   "(b) the conditions provide for effective monitoring of adverse effects using appropriate indicators; and"]
  [9018 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9018 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-00d0-4c25-acd0-00af9ae745ab"]
  [9019 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9019 :block/order "c1FV"]
  [9019 :block/page 448]
  [9019 :block/parent 9012]
  [9019
   :block/title
   "(e) may provide for an activity to step back to a previous stage or cease tem- porarily if triggers or limits are met to allow for management practices or monitoring requirements to be adapted accordingly; and"]
  [9019 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9019 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-baef-4a7d-b996-e861ffbb43e3"]
  [9021 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9021 :block/order "c1FMV"]
  [9021 :block/page 448]
  [9021 :block/parent 448]
  [9021
   :block/title
   "(3) In deciding on the use of an adaptive management approach, the consent authority must consider—"]
  [9021 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9021 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-8cf9-4e04-9538-0ed40fccdcc0"]
  [9022 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9022 :block/order "c1FR"]
  [9022 :block/page 448]
  [9022 :block/parent 9012]
  [9022 :block/title "(i) monitoring and reporting; and"]
  [9022 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9022 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-f05b-4341-af62-dc3f8d847eb6"]
  [9023 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9023 :block/order "c1FW"]
  [9023 :block/page 448]
  [9023 :block/parent 9012]
  [9023
   :block/title
   "(f) may provide for an activity to be discontinued permanently (in circum- stances where the effects are found to be unanticipated at the time that the consent was granted)."]
  [9023 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9023 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-6a1b-46df-9d1f-4774ab478f35"]
  [9024 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9024 :block/order "c1Fd"]
  [9024 :block/page 448]
  [9024 :block/parent 9021]
  [9024
   :block/title
   "(d) the degree of uncertainty about the effects of the activity; and"]
  [9024 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9024 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-9c31-415d-b865-8a809a2376e7"]
  [9025 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9025 :block/order "c1FS"]
  [9025 :block/page 448]
  [9025 :block/parent 9022]
  [9025
   :block/title
   "(ii) setting triggers and limits (other than an environmental limit) for the purpose of monitoring and reporting; and"]
  [9025 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9025 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-1666-4307-8289-223da23c1fb9"]
  [9026 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9026 :block/order "c1FT"]
  [9026 :block/page 448]
  [9026 :block/parent 9012]
  [9026
   :block/title
   "(c) must require ongoing monitoring and reporting; and"]
  [9026 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9026 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-526d-429b-9ad2-f6975054e64b"]
  [9027 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9027 :block/order "c1Fg"]
  [9027 :block/page 448]
  [9027 :block/parent 9005]
  [9027
   :block/title
   "(a) there is sufficient monitoring of the receiving environment to set appro- priate indicators and compliance limits; and"]
  [9027 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9027 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-6201-489a-8703-76fa035d7009"]
  [9028 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9028 :block/order "c1FU"]
  [9028 :block/page 448]
  [9028 :block/parent 9012]
  [9028
   :block/title
   "(d) may require certification and review of environmental management plans; and"]
  [9028 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9028 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-7cbf-4047-9dcf-6affc464bcf6"]
  [9029 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9029 :block/order "c1FZ"]
  [9029 :block/page 448]
  [9029 :block/parent 9021]
  [9029
   :block/title
   "(i) sufficiently reduce uncertainty about the effects of the activity; and"]
  [9029 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9029 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-9d48-437f-b738-60938b18b5e0"]
  [9030 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9030 :block/order "c1FM8"]
  [9030 :block/page 448]
  [9030 :block/parent 448]
  [9030
   :block/title
   "(1) A consent authority may grant a planning consent that includes a condition that requires, or conditions that form, an adaptive management approach."]
  [9030 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9030 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-a156-4bf2-ac31-89d5adb17384"]
  [9031 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [9031 :block/order "c1Fj"]
  [9031 :block/page 448]
  [9031 :block/parent 9005]
  [9031
   :block/title
   "(d) any effects that might arise can be remedied before they become irrever- sible."]
  [9031 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [9031 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-1ac7-47da-b7d4-8a6b67e57086"]
  [9032 :block/created-at 1792209811605]
  [9032 :block/order "c1Fx"]
  [9032 :block/page 450]
  [9032 :block/parent 450]
  [9032 :block/title ""]
  [9032 :block/updated-at 1792209811605]
  [9032 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f393-e0bd-425e-996e-b21ed14e011e"]
