   "(2) The appellant must ensure that a copy of the notice of appeal is served on every person referred to in [section 181]([[6ad2f38a-9e30-4e84-aa2b-045a721aa889]])(1) (other than the appellant) within 5 working days after the notice is lodged with the Environment Court."]
  [9140 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
