   :block/title
   "(2) Any person who appeals under [section 271]([[6ad2f38a-27b4-4fac-8de5-ead07e934648]]) may also apply to an Environment Judge for a stay of the abatement notice pending the Environment Court’s deci- sion on the appeal."]
