  [10717 :block/order "c1iy"]
  [10717 :block/page 271]
  [10717 :block/parent 10714]
  [10717 :block/refs 200]
  [10717
   :block/title
   "(5) The powers under this section are in addition to the powers under sections 268 to 271 to issue abatement notices relating to unreasonable noise and to seek an enforcement order under [section 261]([[6ad2f38a-e1bc-4cef-b6be-126acbb662be]])."]
  [10717 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [10717 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f395-412b-4cb0-9fbd-baed4608b87f"]
  [10718 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [10718 :block/order "c1is"]
  [10718 :block/page 271]
  [10718 :block/parent 10714]
  [10718
   :block/title
   "(1) This section applies if an enforcement officer, or any constable acting on the request of an enforcement officer,—"]
  [10718 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [10718 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f395-74c4-42cf-b186-3dcbc122dffc"]
  [10719 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [10719 :block/order "c1ix"]
  [10719 :block/page 271]
  [10719 :block/parent 10714]
  [10719
   :block/title
   "(4) Every direction under subsection (2) must prohibit the person to whom it is given, and every other person bound by the direction, from causing or contribu- ting to the emission of excessive noise from or within the vicinity of the place at any time during the period of 8 days or any shorter period that the enforce- ment officer or constable specifies, commencing at the time the direction is given."]
  [10719 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [10719 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f395-3b31-4f4a-b4d6-9a5bc15ff864"]
  [10720 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [10720 :block/order "c1iu"]
  [10720 :block/page 271]
  [10720 :block/parent 10718]
  [10720
   :block/title
   "(b) upon investigation of the complaint, is of the opinion that the noise is excessive."]
  [10720 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [10720 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f395-0541-4659-8c07-3c5dfe189db5"]
  [10721 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [10721 :block/order "c1iv"]
  [10721 :block/page 271]
  [10721 :block/parent 10714]
  [10721
   :block/title
   "(2) An enforcement officer, or any constable acting on the request of an enforce- ment officer, may direct the occupier of the place from which the sound is being emitted, or any other person who appears to be responsible for causing the excessive noise, to immediately reduce the noise to a reasonable level."]
  [10721 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [10721 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f395-44e4-4bc3-8c7a-0fc6299d9e29"]
