   "(a) a land use plan requires a planning consent for the activity but does not classify the activity; or"]
  [12096 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12096 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-adb4-4a5e-9e20-989ddd49f241"]
  [12099 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12099 :block/order "c26M"]
  [12099 :block/page 440]
  [12099 :block/parent 440]
  [12099
   :block/title
   "An application for a planning consent for an activity must be treated as an application for a discretionary activity if—"]
  [12099 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12099 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-e856-43f0-b07b-a03001d65449"]
  [12101 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12101 :block/order "c26O"]
  [12101 :block/page 440]
  [12101 :block/parent 12099]
  [12101
   :block/title
   "(b) a rule in a proposed land use plan classifies the activity as a prohibited activity and the rule has not become operative."]
  [12101 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12101 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-620b-463a-be57-4e4d3ffef06f"]
  [12104 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12104 :block/order "c26c"]
  [12104 :block/page 400]
  [12104 :block/parent 12121]
  [12104
   :block/title
   "(b) may require the person carrying out the activity to do 1 or more of the following:"]
  [12104 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12104 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-b24e-4c91-8e81-41be862af89c"]
  [12105 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12105 :block/order "c26W"]
  [12105 :block/page 400]
  [12105 :block/parent 400]
  [12105
   :block/title
   "(1) A permitted activity rule that requires an activity to be registered may be—"]
  [12105 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12105 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-21b2-4f6c-9866-cd09afbfadc2"]
  [12106 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12106 :block/order "c26X"]
  [12106 :block/page 400]
  [12106 :block/parent 12105]
  [12106 :block/title "(a) a national rule; or"]
  [12106 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12106 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-b800-4c93-9e7c-34d95b1dc132"]
  [12107 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12107 :block/order "c26i"]
  [12107 :block/page 400]
  [12107 :block/parent 12121]
  [12107 :block/title "(c) may not specify any other requirement."]
  [12107 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12107 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-cf9a-4fca-a26c-ffe3695ead17"]
  [12108 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12108 :block/order "c26Y"]
  [12108 :block/page 400]
  [12108 :block/parent 12105]
  [12108
   :block/title
   "(b) a rule in a land use plan but only if allowed or required by national standards."]
  [12108 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12108 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-c22f-4a56-af81-f27717f680bb"]
  [12111 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12111 :block/order "c26b"]
  [12111 :block/page 400]
  [12111 :block/parent 12121]
  [12111 :block/refs 376]
  [12111
   :block/title
   "(a) may specify requirements for information that must be included in the notice required under [section 210]([[6ad2f38a-4a87-4a17-bab6-69a19a6d58a1]]); and"]
  [12111 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12111 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-0e83-47c5-97f0-769479a77978"]
  [12112 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12112 :block/order "c26e"]
  [12112 :block/page 400]
  [12112 :block/parent 12116]
  [12112
   :block/title
   "(ii) obtain certification from a qualified person that the activity com- plies, or would comply, with any specified requirement:"]
  [12112 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12112 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-5027-4bb1-8bf3-b6e4866be35e"]
  [12113 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12113 :block/order "c26h"]
  [12113 :block/page 400]
  [12113 :block/parent 12121]
  [12113 :block/refs 906]
  [12113
   :block/title
   "(v) comply with a condition of a kind that may be included under sec- tion 178 or Part 1 of [Schedule 7]([[6ad2f38b-c162-4df6-808f-6483d9eecf14]]); but"]
  [12113 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12113 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-a844-43fb-97fe-11cc5d4c8e6d"]
  [12115 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12115 :block/order "c26g"]
  [12115 :block/page 400]
  [12115 :block/parent 12116]
  [12115
   :block/title
   "(iv) carry out the activity in accordance with a report or management plan prepared by a qualified person:"]
  [12115 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12115 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-7c50-4998-8d4f-c185e9761b95"]
  [12116 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12116 :block/order "c26d"]
  [12116 :block/page 400]
  [12116 :block/parent 12121]
  [12116
   :block/title
   "(i) obtain the written approval of all persons who may be directly affected by the activity:"]
  [12116 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12116 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-e8a7-493f-8ce6-79eecdc67bfd"]
  [12117 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12117 :block/order "c26f"]
  [12117 :block/page 400]
  [12117 :block/parent 12116]
  [12117 :block/refs 231]
  [12117
   :block/title
   "(iii) pay a fee fixed in accordance with [section 329]([[6ad2f38a-bc15-408d-beac-98f48197c389]]):"]
  [12117 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12117 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-4070-4be8-aead-1e0efcdd577e"]
  [12118 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12118 :block/order "c26Z"]
  [12118 :block/page 400]
  [12118 :block/parent 400]
  [12118 :block/refs 324]
  [12118
   :block/title
   "(4) See also [section 38]([[6ad2f38a-511d-44cf-89c3-e9b3afc6f61f]])(1)(b) which requires a permitted activity to comply with any requirements in every instrument."]
  [12118 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12118 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-39fe-42b8-9c3f-82810715779d"]
  [12121 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12121 :block/order "c26Y"]
  [12121 :block/page 400]
  [12121 :block/parent 400]
  [12121
   :block/title
   "(3) A permitted activity rule that requires an activity to be registered—"]
  [12121 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12121 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-0689-4760-9e76-cc588fe8ad04"]
  [12122 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12122 :block/order "c26X"]
  [12122 :block/page 400]
  [12122 :block/parent 400]
  [12122 :block/refs 376]
  [12122
   :block/title
   "(2) If a permitted activity rule requires an activity to be registered, [section 210]([[6ad2f38a-4a87-4a17-bab6-69a19a6d58a1]]) applies."]
  [12122 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12122 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-ea51-4929-872b-e385cad387fc"]
  [12123 :block/created-at 1792209815726]
  [12123 :block/order "c272"]
  [12123 :block/page 499]
  [12123 :block/parent 499]
  [12123 :block/title ""]
  [12123 :block/updated-at 1792209815726]
  [12123 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-b4af-4e22-a58e-a850ed0b790c"]
  [12124 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12124 :block/order "c26r"]
  [12124 :block/page 499]
  [12124 :block/parent 499]
  [12124
   :block/title
   "(1) This section applies for the purposes of sections 44 to 47."]
  [12124 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12124 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-6547-40f5-a042-117082508ff2"]
  [12126 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12126 :block/order "c26v"]
  [12126 :block/page 499]
  [12126 :block/parent 12131]
  [12126
   :block/title
   "(c) prohibits or restricts an activity that the national rule permits or author- ises."]
  [12126 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12126 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-2f78-4c61-a11b-613033206cce"]
  [12127 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12127 :block/order "c26u"]
  [12127 :block/page 499]
  [12127 :block/parent 12131]
  [12127
   :block/title
   "(b) imposes conditions on an activity that the national rule does not impose or authorise; or"]
  [12127 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12127 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-9776-4613-8328-aa8889489d7b"]
  [12128 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12128 :block/order "c26t"]
  [12128 :block/page 499]
  [12128 :block/parent 499]
  [12128
   :block/title
   "(3) An instrument is more enabling than a national rule if the instrument—"]
  [12128 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12128 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-6d12-4660-bf31-0c5babf53fe8"]
  [12129 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12129 :block/order "c26z"]
  [12129 :block/page 499]
  [12129 :block/parent 12128]
  [12129
   :block/title
   "(c) permits or authorises an activity that the national rule prohibits or restricts."]
  [12129 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12129 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-48f5-4016-96d9-7459667478d4"]
  [12130 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12130 :block/order "c26x"]
  [12130 :block/page 499]
  [12130 :block/parent 12128]
  [12130
   :block/title
   "(a) classifies an activity less restrictively than the national rule; or"]
  [12130 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12130 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-613a-4fa8-b0c8-100716d63616"]
  [12131 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12131 :block/order "c26s"]
  [12131 :block/page 499]
  [12131 :block/parent 499]
  [12131
   :block/title
   "(2) An instrument is more restrictive than a national rule if the instrument—"]
  [12131 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12131 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-6e25-4e66-85ae-d3219a2c895f"]
  [12132 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12132 :block/order "c26y"]
  [12132 :block/page 499]
  [12132 :block/parent 12128]
  [12132
   :block/title
   "(b) does not impose conditions or imposes less restrictive conditions on an activity in respect of which conditions are imposed or authorised by the national rule; or"]
  [12132 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12132 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-3ae3-4ef3-b129-1c0b308833cf"]
  [12135 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12135 :block/order "a0"]
  [12135 :block/page 499]
  [12135 :block/parent 12137]
  [12135 :block/title ""]
  [12135 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12135 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-b391-4f40-a28b-6954aaffb507"]
  [12136 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12136 :block/order "c26t"]
  [12136 :block/page 499]
  [12136 :block/parent 12131]
  [12136
   :block/title
   "(a) classifies an activity more restrictively than the national rule; or"]
  [12136 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12136 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-4526-4dbe-8813-83061ae4e021"]
  [12137 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12137 :block/order "c26u"]
  [12137 :block/page 499]
  [12137 :block/parent 499]
  [12137
   :block/title
   "(4) In this section, an instrument means a rule in a land use plan, a rule in a pro- posed land use plan that has legal effect, a planning consent, a designation, a construction project plan, or a bylaw."]
  [12137 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12137 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-1ba8-4683-94af-163fabf9e4b5"]
  [12138 :block/created-at 1792209815743]
  [12138 :block/order "c27G"]
  [12138 :block/page 510]
  [12138 :block/parent 510]
  [12138 :block/title ""]
  [12138 :block/updated-at 1792209815743]
  [12138 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-2c5d-4472-b6ea-852be8012a75"]
  [12139 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12139 :block/order "a0"]
  [12139 :block/page 510]
  [12139 :block/parent 12141]
  [12139 :block/title ""]
  [12139 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12139 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-9100-4903-9e74-763adee6371f"]
  [12140 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12140 :block/order "c27D"]
  [12140 :block/page 510]
  [12140 :block/parent 12148]
  [12140
   :block/title
   "(c) if a plan’s conditions deal with effects of the activity that are the same as those dealt with in the conditions specified in the national rule, the con- ditions in the national rule prevail."]
  [12140 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12140 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-58b6-4234-912a-5f4d11bd8d63"]
  [12141 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12141 :block/order "c27B"]
  [12141 :block/page 510]
  [12141 :block/parent 510]
  [12141
   :block/title
   "(4) In this section, plan means a land use plan and proposed plan means a pro- posed land use plan that has legal effect."]
  [12141 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12141 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-16cf-4f63-8ca5-cddde81933b9"]
  [12142 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12142 :block/order "c279"]
  [12142 :block/page 510]
  [12142 :block/parent 510]
  [12142
   :block/title
   "(2) A rule in a plan or proposed plan that is more enabling than a national rule pre- vails over the national rule if the national rule expressly allows a rule in a plan or proposed plan to be more enabling than it."]
  [12142 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12142 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-69e7-47bb-8d3d-8de70562337f"]
  [12146 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12146 :block/order "c27B"]
  [12146 :block/page 510]
  [12146 :block/parent 12148]
  [12146
   :block/title
   "(a) a plan or proposed plan may state that the activity is a permitted activity on the conditions specified in the plan; and"]
  [12146 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12146 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-410f-4615-800e-5b020b4a5ad4"]
  [12147 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12147 :block/order "c27C"]
  [12147 :block/page 510]
  [12147 :block/parent 12148]
  [12147
   :block/title
   "(b) the conditions specified in the plan may deal only with effects of the activity that are different from those dealt with in conditions specified in the national rule; and"]
  [12147 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12147 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-ee62-418f-991e-0cadafad0252"]
  [12148 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12148 :block/order "c27A"]
  [12148 :block/page 510]
  [12148 :block/parent 510]
  [12148
   :block/title
   "(3) If a national rule allows an activity and states that a planning consent is not required for the activity, or states that an activity is a permitted activity, the fol- lowing provisions apply:"]
  [12148 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12148 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-3db0-4ca4-805b-908bb3c4019e"]
  [12150 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12150 :block/order "c278"]
  [12150 :block/page 510]
  [12150 :block/parent 510]
  [12150
   :block/title
   "(1) A rule in a plan or proposed plan that is more restrictive than a national rule prevails over the national rule if the national rule expressly allows a rule in a plan or proposed plan to be more restrictive than it."]
  [12150 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12150 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-22be-40fc-aa49-8e47dbc40c5e"]
  [12151 :block/created-at 1792209815760]
  [12151 :block/order "c27S"]
  [12151 :block/page 331]
  [12151 :block/parent 331]
  [12151 :block/title ""]
  [12151 :block/updated-at 1792209815760]
  [12151 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-dd01-4e23-b342-f57e85dd15a2"]
  [12153 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12153 :block/order "c27M"]
  [12153 :block/page 331]
  [12153 :block/parent 331]
  [12153
   :block/title
   "(2) A planning consent that is more enabling than a national rule prevails over the rule if the rule expressly allows a planning consent to be more enabling than it."]
  [12153 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12153 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-fc1f-4ac2-8e26-f5bd0ab22f23"]
  [12154 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12154 :block/order "c27O"]
  [12154 :block/page 331]
  [12154 :block/parent 331]
  [12154
   :block/title
   "(4) The planning consent prevails over the national rule unless the rule expressly provides otherwise."]
  [12154 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [12154 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f397-864c-4974-b528-836ae9c9db07"]
  [12155 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [12155 :block/order "c27N"]
  [12155 :block/page 331]
  [12155 :block/parent 331]
  [12155
   :block/title
   "(3) Subsection (4) applies if a planning consent—"]
