  [13014
   :block/title
   "(5) Part 3 of [Schedule 3]([[6ad2f38b-7bdd-40b7-bac9-e5192df8b9cd]]) sets out provisions relating to when rules in a proposed land use plan have legal effect."]
  [13014 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [13014 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f398-ab2f-4d86-b7fa-09c3d6045730"]
  [13018 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [13018 :block/order "c2MD"]
  [13018 :block/page 295]
  [13018 :block/parent 295]
  [13018 :block/refs 910]
  [13018
   :block/title
   "(4) Any person (other than the local authority that prepared the plan) may request a change to a land use plan in accordance with Part 2 of [Schedule 3]([[6ad2f38b-7bdd-40b7-bac9-e5192df8b9cd]])."]
  [13018 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [13018 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f398-5951-4f40-936e-8a3a93f89433"]
  [13019 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [13019 :block/order "c2MC"]
  [13019 :block/page 295]
  [13019 :block/parent 295]
  [13019
   :block/title
   "(3) A regional council must prepare or change the land use plan for the coastal marine area within its region in accordance with Parts 1, 2, and 4 of Sched- ule 3."]
  [13019 :block/updated-at 1792002820000]
  [13019 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f398-7ca5-46a5-a674-9fa869cb4bb3"]
  [13020 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [13020 :block/order "c2MA"]
  [13020 :block/page 295]
  [13020 :block/parent 295]
  [13020 :block/refs 910]
  [13020
   :block/title
   "(1) [Schedule 3]([[6ad2f38b-7bdd-40b7-bac9-e5192df8b9cd]]) has effect according to its terms."]
  [13020 :block/updated-at 1792387338064]
  [13020 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad2f398-57fb-4242-976e-c364220c16d8"]
  [13021 :block/created-at 1792002820000]
  [13021 :block/order "c2MB"]
  [13021 :block/page 295]
  [13021 :block/parent 295]
  [13021 :block/refs 910]
  [13021
   :block/title
   "(2) A territorial authority must prepare or change the land use plan for its district in accordance with Parts 1, 2, and 4 of [Schedule 3]([[6ad2f38b-7bdd-40b7-bac9-e5192df8b9cd]])."]
