  [13411 :block/title "NPD Cross-cutting Directives"]
  [13411 :block/updated-at 1792483414202]
  [13411 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44871-898c-4a62-98af-d9553d9bf656"]
  [13412 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13412 :block/order "a0"]
  [13412 :block/page 13411]
  [13412 :block/parent 13411]
  [13412
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 1: **Private property rights**. When implementing this NPD, the use of private land is to be enabled with restrictions only imposed when necessary to ensure others are not unreasonably affected or to provide for important public values."]
  [13412 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13412 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44871-bd8e-4a27-8fd1-0771688b7824"]
  [13413 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13413 :block/order "a2"]
  [13413 :block/page 13411]
  [13413 :block/parent 13411]
  [13413
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 2: **Economic growth.** When implementing this NPD, economic  is to be supported by:"]
  [13413 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13413 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-b015-4ea9-80cb-ac76c059abf1"]
  [13414 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13414 :block/order "a0"]
  [13414 :block/page 13411]
  [13414 :block/parent 13413]
  [13414
   :block/title
   "a) being responsive to new and emerging economic opportunities"]
  [13414 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13414 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-90cd-40f4-861c-1865c18e95a0"]
  [13415 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13415 :block/order "a1"]
  [13415 :block/page 13411]
  [13415 :block/parent 13413]
  [13415 :block/title "b) providing certainty for investment"]
  [13415 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13415 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-17d5-4daf-b37b-4e707aa51375"]
  [13416 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13416 :block/order "a2"]
  [13416 :block/page 13411]
  [13416 :block/parent 13413]
  [13416
   :block/title
   "c) reducing unnecessary costs and constraints for projects that drive economic growth and employment."]
  [13416 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13416 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-78d8-4d18-bda2-248de8d442e4"]
  [13417 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13417 :block/order "a6"]
  [13417 :block/page 13411]
  [13417 :block/parent 13411]
  [13417
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 3: **Managing land use and reverse sensitivity.** To protect the operation of existing lawfully established land uses:"]
  [13417 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13417 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-66a6-46ba-b474-fafbe5610195"]
  [13418 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13418 :block/order "a0"]
  [13418 :block/page 13411]
  [13418 :block/parent 13417]
  [13418 :block/title "a)  must:"]
  [13418 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13418 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-b2c0-401e-b96d-265208996733"]
  [13419 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13419 :block/order "a0"]
  [13419 :block/page 13411]
  [13419 :block/parent 13418]
  [13419
   :block/title
   "i) Enable existing lawfully established land uses to operate without unreasonable ."]
  [13419 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13419 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-e7be-4987-9af3-1126bebd16d3"]
  [13420 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13420 :block/order "a1"]
  [13420 :block/page 13411]
  [13420 :block/parent 13418]
  [13420
   :block/title
   "ii) Ensure new incompatible or sensitive activities are responsible for avoiding or mitigating conflicts with existing lawfully established land uses, both through location and mitigation methods."]
  [13420 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13420 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-1845-4799-8982-09e88ae0be9a"]
  [13421 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13421 :block/order "a1"]
  [13421 :block/page 13411]
  [13421 :block/parent 13417]
  [13421
   :block/title
   "b) Local authorities must manage complaints from new, or more intensive, sensitive activities about existing land uses [in accordance with national standards]."]
  [13421 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13421 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-b98a-4855-877e-89deb251ea04"]
  [13422 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13422 :block/order "aB"]
  [13422 :block/page 13411]
  [13422 :block/parent 13411]
  [13422
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 4: **Managing land use and reverse sensitivity.** To enable the use of land and support growth and change while minimising conflicts between land uses:"]
  [13422 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13422 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-c5e7-42e0-acdf-3a54b4787fab"]
  [13423 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13423 :block/order "a0"]
  [13423 :block/page 13411]
  [13423 :block/parent 13422]
  [13423
   :block/title
   "a) Spatial plans must identify broad land use patterns, where incompatible land uses may conflict, and identify where separation and management of incompatible land uses is required."]
  [13423 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13423 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-abd8-4251-9c8e-9819ad833410"]
  [13424 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13424 :block/order "a1"]
  [13424 :block/page 13411]
  [13424 :block/parent 13422]
  [13424
   :block/title
   "b) Land use plans must use a range of planning tools and methods, including (where appropriate):"]
  [13424 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13424 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-e464-492d-9d05-81305831593b"]
  [13425 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13425 :block/order "a0"]
  [13425 :block/page 13411]
  [13425 :block/parent 13424]
  [13425
   :block/title
   "i) Zoning to identify anticipated land uses that are enabled without unreasonable constraint."]
  [13425 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13425 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-589d-4d2a-9c25-cc9f33144234"]
  [13426 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13426 :block/order "a1"]
  [13426 :block/page 13411]
  [13426 :block/parent 13424]
  [13426
   :block/title
   "ii) Buffers to separate and manage incompatible land uses [eg, setbacks to established industries]."]
  [13426 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13426 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-0da4-4095-98c0-a7ac88b0222d"]
  [13427 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13427 :block/order "a2"]
  [13427 :block/page 13411]
  [13427 :block/parent 13424]
  [13427
   :block/title
   "iii) Standards and methods to manage the external effects of land uses and improve compatibility between land uses [eg, noise insulation standards]."]
  [13427 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13427 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-12ab-4edc-976d-1fda98be9f63"]
  [13428 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13428 :block/order "a2"]
  [13428 :block/page 13411]
  [13428 :block/parent 13422]
  [13428
   :block/title
   "c) Land use plans must recognise the role of private agreements, including non-complaint covenants, in managing conflicts and complaints between land uses."]
  [13428 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13428 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-bfc0-4619-9a2f-b3736d88442f"]
  [13429 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13429 :block/order "aI"]
  [13429 :block/page 13411]
  [13429 :block/parent 13411]
  [13429
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 5: Regional spatial plans prioritise growth and change in areas:"]
  [13429 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13429 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-0d1d-4a78-84b4-7b89046875e8"]
  [13430 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13430 :block/order "a0"]
  [13430 :block/page 13411]
  [13430 :block/parent 13429]
  [13430
   :block/title
   "a) Where infrastructure can efficiently support growth and change."]
  [13430 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13430 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-9620-452f-ac37-dc46f8b97ef7"]
  [13431 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13431 :block/order "a1"]
  [13431 :block/page 13411]
  [13431 :block/parent 13429]
  [13431
   :block/title
   "b) That make the best use of existing and planned infrastructure."]
  [13431 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13431 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-c429-4d4f-82c1-d96edf985861"]
  [13432 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13432 :block/order "a2"]
  [13432 :block/page 13411]
  [13432 :block/parent 13429]
  [13432
   :block/title
   "c) That support access to housing and labour markets."]
  [13432 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13432 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-c8f1-4f56-b9bd-756fc1c2539a"]
  [13433 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13433 :block/order "a3"]
  [13433 :block/page 13411]
  [13433 :block/parent 13429]
  [13433 :block/title "d) Where can be managed."]
  [13433 :block/updated-at 1792297156549]
  [13433 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-0d70-41cb-912d-2c47e539fd38"]
  [13434 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13434 :block/order "a4"]
  [13434 :block/page 13411]
  [13434 :block/parent 13429]
  [13434
   :block/title
   "e) That provide for significant environmental and cultural values."]
  [13434 :block/updated-at 1792297258332]
  [13434 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-8120-4b9a-aecb-d1ec64ae7b6e"]
  [13435 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13435 :block/order "aO"]
  [13435 :block/page 13411]
  [13435 :block/parent 13411]
  [13435
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 6: Regional spatial plans sequence growth, change and infrastructure to support:"]
  [13435 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13435 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-af54-474d-866c-328f4a17c34a"]
  [13436 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13436 :block/order "a0"]
  [13436 :block/page 13411]
  [13436 :block/parent 13435]
  [13436 :block/title "a) Efficient public investment."]
  [13436 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13436 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-7a02-44cd-8b18-c4e6e0fdbefd"]
  [13437 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13437 :block/order "a1"]
  [13437 :block/page 13411]
  [13437 :block/parent 13435]
  [13437
   :block/title
   "b) Strategic opportunities for development where infrastructure may be provided via private or other means of investment."]
  [13437 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13437 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-22b3-4486-a5f0-a935f74f946f"]
  [13438 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13438 :block/order "aR"]
  [13438 :block/page 13411]
  [13438 :block/parent 13411]
  [13438
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 7: Regional spatial plans seek to:"]
  [13438 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13438 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-f76f-4ab7-b7f9-93c13d6d6e04"]
  [13439 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13439 :block/order "a0"]
  [13439 :block/page 13411]
  [13439 :block/parent 13438]
  [13439
   :block/title
   "a) Maximise compatibility (and otherwise minimise conflicts) between development, the natural environment and cultural values over the long term, including by identifying:"]
  [13439 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13439 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-295d-43d5-a743-19161c4da1aa"]
  [13440 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13440 :block/order "a0"]
  [13440 :block/page 13411]
  [13440 :block/parent 13439]
  [13440
   :block/title
   "i) Where development may need to be constrained because of  ."]
  [13440 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13440 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-0a75-462a-8bef-a94101a4266a"]
  [13441 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13441 :block/order "a1"]
  [13441 :block/page 13411]
  [13441 :block/parent 13439]
  [13441
   :block/title
   "ii) How growth can be provided while protecting  [eg, food and fibre production]."]
  [13441 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13441 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-9b42-4b2f-bd3f-70e76217b843"]
  [13442 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13442 :block/order "a2"]
  [13442 :block/page 13411]
  [13442 :block/parent 13439]
  [13442
   :block/title
   "iii) Where may need to be provided where there are natural environment constraints."]
  [13442 :block/updated-at 1792483414202]
  [13442 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-9036-4815-822d-2ffedaf93ec3"]
  [13443 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13443 :block/order "a3"]
  [13443 :block/page 13411]
  [13443 :block/parent 13439]
  [13443
   :block/title
   "iv) Strategic opportunities to provide for development while enhancing the natural environment."]
  [13443 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13443 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-082b-4d6d-af4c-f7c27d1c8787"]
  [13444 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13444 :block/order "a1"]
  [13444 :block/page 13411]
  [13444 :block/parent 13438]
  [13444
   :block/title
   "b) Avoid unnecessary long-term costs to communities and the public."]
  [13444 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13444 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-71fa-415f-81f4-3dcf73a22bdb"]
  [13445 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13445 :block/order "aY"]
  [13445 :block/page 13411]
  [13445 :block/parent 13411]
  [13445
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 8: Land use plans and natural environment plans should avoid unnecessary duplication or inconsistent regulatory requirements in relation to activities regulated under other legislation."]
  [13445 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13445 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-3db3-4bb5-8355-ae7c36a408b5"]
  [13446 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13446 :block/order "aZ"]
  [13446 :block/page 13411]
  [13446 :block/parent 13411]
  [13446
   :block/title
   "CC-Directive 9: While a range of information and views may be provided through consent/permit processes, responsibility for deciding whether to grant, decline, or impose conditions on a consent/permit application rests with the relevant statutory decision-maker identified in the legislation."]
  [13446 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13446 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-b0db-4cac-bd29-bc2f1fbcc9c1"]
  [13447 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13447 :block/order "aa"]
  [13447 :block/page 13411]
  [13447 :block/parent 13411]
  [13447
   :block/title
   "Indicative Implementation Through National Standards (Not Part of the NPD)"]
  [13447 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13447 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-79d3-4ecd-96a5-3c8d601e73b0"]
  [13448 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13448 :block/order "a0"]
  [13448 :block/page 13411]
  [13448 :block/parent 13447]
  [13448 :block/title "National standards for land use plans:"]
  [13448 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13448 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-0927-4ab7-a7d2-ab264d428544"]
  [13449 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13449 :block/order "a0"]
  [13449 :block/page 13411]
  [13449 :block/parent 13448]
  [13449
   :block/title
   "Set out nationally consistent requirements for managing reverse sensitivity effects, including separation distances, buffers and overlays to protect established land uses from new sensitive and incompatible activities."]
  [13449 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13449 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-f455-430f-b407-a75177894ac0"]
  [13450 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13450 :block/order "a1"]
  [13450 :block/page 13411]
  [13450 :block/parent 13448]
  [13450
   :block/title
   "Require new sensitive or incompatible activities to avoid or mitigate their effects on existing land uses."]
  [13450 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13450 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-98af-4c6f-a9b2-4ee50b09ab3a"]
  [13451 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13451 :block/order "a2"]
  [13451 :block/page 13411]
  [13451 :block/parent 13448]
  [13451
   :block/title
   "Set clear expectations for the anticipated land uses within zones that are to be enabled without unreasonable constraint from sensitive and incompatible activities."]
  [13451 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13451 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-b9c0-4ba8-b7e9-7924d412f91a"]
  [13452 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13452 :block/order "a1"]
  [13452 :block/page 13411]
  [13452 :block/parent 13447]
  [13452 :block/title "National standards for managing complaints:"]
  [13452 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13452 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-2e9f-4873-9f3f-cede90e2c9c7"]
  [13453 :block/created-at 1792297084417]
  [13453 :block/order "a0"]
  [13453 :block/page 13411]
  [13453 :block/parent 13452]
  [13453
   :block/title
   "Require local authorities to manage complaints from new, or more intensive, sensitive activities about existing land uses in a nationally consistent way, including how to consider complaints about effects that are known and lawfully established, anticipated, or reasonably foreseeable in particular locations."]
  [13453 :block/updated-at 1792297084417]
  [13453 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad4487c-1f7a-4704-a3e2-dbca1eac0df0"]
  [13454 :block/created-at 1792297552705]
