  [13518 :block/order "a0"]
  [13518 :block/page 13517]
  [13518 :block/parent 13517]
  [13518
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.1:**  must identify the strategic infrastructure priorities that shape how the region grows and changes."]
  [13518 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13518 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5e-6773-4a9e-bb72-33e68dc29429"]
  [13519 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13519 :block/order "a2"]
  [13519 :block/page 13517]
  [13519 :block/parent 13517]
  [13519 :block/title ""]
  [13519 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13519 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-4748-47f0-bdba-a5b9e2c5e445"]
  [13520 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13520 :block/order "a3"]
  [13520 :block/page 13517]
  [13520 :block/parent 13517]
  [13520
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.2:** To enable the timely and efficient delivery of new infrastructure, including all ancillary activities, and upgrades, expansions, replacements and relocations not covered under existing infrastructure directives [INFR-Directive 1.3 & 1.4], land use plans and natural environment plans must:"]
  [13520 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13520 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-7102-492a-8c45-4df78883f9f0"]
  [13521 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13521 :block/order "a4"]
  [13521 :block/page 13517]
  [13521 :block/parent 13520]
  [13521
   :block/title
   "a) Recognise and provide for the national, regional and local benefits of infrastructure."]
  [13521 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13521 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-151c-4c11-8e6d-f83b3f7ceef9"]
  [13522 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13522 :block/order "a5"]
  [13522 :block/page 13517]
  [13522 :block/parent 13520]
  [13522
   :block/title
   "b) Recognise and provide for infrastructure to have an operational or functional need to locate, operate and traverse particular environments."]
  [13522 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13522 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-729f-4f95-8ff6-e8e9199e1673"]
  [13523 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13523 :block/order "a6"]
  [13523 :block/page 13517]
  [13523 :block/parent 13520]
  [13523
   :block/title
   "c) Manage effects on important identified values in accordance with any relevant national standards."]
  [13523 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13523 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-b46e-4550-add3-441d2059153c"]
  [13524 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13524 :block/order "a7"]
  [13524 :block/page 13517]
  [13524 :block/parent 13520]
  [13524
   :block/title
   "d) Apply targeted standardised plan provisions that recognise the specific needs, locations, accessibility and operational requirements of different infrastructure, such as linear and non-linear infrastructure [eg, port reclamation, dredging and operating hours]."]
  [13524 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13524 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-d7d9-4561-876f-5cc37ef1ebe1"]
  [13525 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13525 :block/order "a8"]
  [13525 :block/page 13517]
  [13525 :block/parent 13520]
  [13525
   :block/title
   "e) Recognise the role of the infrastructure provider and requirements under other legislation [eg, Commerce Act for Transpower] in determining the route or location of the infrastructure required."]
  [13525 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13525 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-3974-4289-8696-1bf92d0be22a"]
  [13526 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13526 :block/order "a9"]
  [13526 :block/page 13517]
  [13526 :block/parent 13517]
  [13526 :block/title ""]
  [13526 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13526 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-7547-4948-a11d-734a3294df92"]
  [13527 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13527 :block/order "aA"]
  [13527 :block/page 13517]
  [13527 :block/parent 13517]
  [13527
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.3:** To enable existing infrastructure to efficiently and effectively maintain, increase or improve services delivered to people and communities, land use plans and natural environment plans must enable:"]
  [13527 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13527 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-b17c-4d9e-9e78-9597863272fc"]
  [13528 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13528 :block/order "aB"]
  [13528 :block/page 13517]
  [13528 :block/parent 13527]
  [13528
   :block/title
   "a) Operation, maintenance, upgrade and repowering activities and all ancillary activities to be undertaken without unnecessary restriction within its operational envelope [see interpretation section]."]
  [13528 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13528 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-426f-474c-8499-a0b13ae13e1e"]
  [13529 :block/created-at 1792297823217]
  [13529 :block/order "aC"]
  [13529 :block/page 13517]
  [13529 :block/parent 13527]
  [13529
   :block/title
   "b) Upgrade and relocation activities outside its operational envelope that increase safety, increase resilience, utilise new technology or reduce environmental effects, subject to infrastructure standards to manage effects."]
  [13529 :block/updated-at 1792297823217]
  [13529 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-5a75-44d0-8803-b29c2255eb1b"]
  [13530 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13530 :block/order "aD"]
  [13530 :block/page 13517]
  [13530 :block/parent 13517]
  [13530 :block/title ""]
  [13530 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13530 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-e6e2-44da-bb5b-7f70211e39ce"]
  [13531 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13531 :block/order "aE"]
  [13531 :block/page 13517]
  [13531 :block/parent 13517]
  [13531
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.4:** To get the most out of existing infrastructure assets,  must:"]
  [13531 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13531 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-a5ac-4885-92a0-a7ab8b041c9a"]
  [13532 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13532 :block/order "aF"]
  [13532 :block/page 13517]
  [13532 :block/parent 13531]
  [13532
   :block/title
   "a) Provide for existing infrastructure to access and use natural resources to provide for ongoing infrastructure services."]
  [13532 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13532 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-c241-4e2d-bf53-c2f030d56b34"]
  [13533 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13533 :block/order "aG"]
  [13533 :block/page 13517]
  [13533 :block/parent 13531]
  [13533
   :block/title
   "b) Recognise existing infrastructure that uses existing natural resources forms part of the existing environment when assessing environmental effects in re-permitting decisions."]
  [13533 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13533 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-4698-4d5f-af47-9975813cae87"]
  [13534 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13534 :block/order "aH"]
  [13534 :block/page 13517]
  [13534 :block/parent 13517]
  [13534 :block/title ""]
  [13534 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13534 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-7063-44a3-a148-9713774d0e68"]
  [13535 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13535 :block/order "aI"]
  [13535 :block/page 13517]
  [13535 :block/parent 13517]
  [13535
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.5:** To manage conflicts between infrastructure and significant natural environment values and significant historic heritage,  and  must manage adverse effects in accordance with national standards:"]
  [13535 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13535 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-dc60-49cd-a76e-01daadba9f72"]
  [13536 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13536 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13536 :block/page 13517]
  [13536 :block/parent 13535]
  [13536
   :block/title
   "a) On high natural character, outstanding natural landscapes and features, and on significant historic heritage excluding sites of significance to Māori, under the Planning Bill, and on all domains where environmental limits have been set under the Natural Environment Bill."]
  [13536 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13536 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-a865-4d0e-8231-c96c64fef94d"]
  [13537 :block/created-at 1792297823218]
  [13537 :block/order "aK"]
  [13537 :block/page 13517]
  [13537 :block/parent 13535]
  [13537
   :block/title
   "b) Where any breach of environmental limits occurs, by developing and implementing an action plan to remedy the breach within a set target date."]
  [13537 :block/updated-at 1792297823218]
  [13537 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b5f-2830-4ffd-9168-aa00f81dd47d"]
  [13538 :block/created-at 1792297824713]
  [13538 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13538 :block/page 13517]
  [13538 :block/parent 13517]
  [13538 :block/title ""]
  [13538 :block/updated-at 1792297824713]
  [13538 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b60-c506-4706-8d39-2eee5282b295"]
  [13539 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13539 :block/order "aK"]
  [13539 :block/page 13517]
  [13539 :block/parent 13517]
  [13539 :block/title ""]
  [13539 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13539 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44b61-1fb5-4642-b881-8efd74fc52d6"]
  [13540 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13540 :block/order "aM"]
  [13540 :block/page 13517]
  [13540 :block/parent 13517]
  [13540
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.6:** and  must enable nature-based solutions and green infrastructure."]
  [13540 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13540 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-81f9-40f4-a546-01cecab10d8a"]
  [13541 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13541 :block/order "aN"]
  [13541 :block/page 13517]
  [13541 :block/parent 13540]
  [13541 :block/title ""]
  [13541 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13541 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-f875-4d23-91fc-e2d3e8363772"]
  [13542 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13542 :block/order "aO"]
  [13542 :block/page 13517]
  [13542 :block/parent 13517]
  [13542
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 1.7:** To protect existing or planned infrastructure and enable its ongoing operation, maintenance, upgrading and reasonable expansion:"]
  [13542 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13542 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-e118-4e8d-9d4f-4b3117c1e56f"]
  [13543 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13543 :block/order "aP"]
  [13543 :block/page 13517]
  [13543 :block/parent 13542]
  [13543 :block/title "a)  must identify, at a broad level:"]
  [13543 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13543 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-859a-42af-b90f-deb50c933690"]
  [13544 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13544 :block/order "aQ"]
  [13544 :block/page 13517]
  [13544 :block/parent 13543]
  [13544
   :block/title
   "i)  and areas where infrastructure needs to be protected from  ."]
  [13544 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13544 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-c9f1-4bb2-8d61-987d4448d0c5"]
  [13545 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13545 :block/order "aR"]
  [13545 :block/page 13517]
  [13545 :block/parent 13543]
  [13545
   :block/title
   "ii)  to support the ongoing operation and future development of infrastructure."]
  [13545 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13545 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-4fb8-47fd-89eb-d4b79d08e20e"]
  [13546 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13546 :block/order "aS"]
  [13546 :block/page 13517]
  [13546 :block/parent 13543]
  [13546
   :block/title
   "iii) Areas to support the co-location of compatible infrastructure, including through infrastructure corridors."]
  [13546 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13546 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-3597-4b5e-b301-41782a75bb3f"]
  [13547 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13547 :block/order "aT"]
  [13547 :block/page 13517]
  [13547 :block/parent 13542]
  [13547 :block/title "b) Land use plans must:"]
  [13547 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13547 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-3f60-4255-b01b-6e62a61d41a0"]
  [13548 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13548 :block/order "aU"]
  [13548 :block/page 13517]
  [13548 :block/parent 13547]
  [13548
   :block/title
   "i) Protect the operation, maintenance, upgrading and reasonable expansion of infrastructure from the adverse effects of incompatible land uses, including reverse sensitivity and direct effects."]
  [13548 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13548 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-daea-4592-b9c1-2410b0dd10d7"]
  [13549 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13549 :block/order "aV"]
  [13549 :block/page 13517]
  [13549 :block/parent 13547]
  [13549
   :block/title
   "ii) Require new sensitive activities to avoid or mitigate effects that could result in unreasonable constraints on infrastructure."]
  [13549 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13549 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-f66e-4136-b9f0-622b728b8509"]
  [13550 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13550 :block/order "aW"]
  [13550 :block/page 13517]
  [13550 :block/parent 13547]
  [13550
   :block/title
   "iii) Use a range of planning tools and methods to protect infrastructure and support compatibility with other land uses, including:"]
  [13550 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13550 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-f2ea-492c-aa0a-aa43e1305a82"]
  [13551 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13551 :block/order "aX"]
  [13551 :block/page 13517]
  [13551 :block/parent 13550]
  [13551
   :block/title
   "a. Through buffers to separate incompatible land uses."]
  [13551 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13551 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-3d8f-4b0f-95a7-00b43dd0e67d"]
  [13552 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13552 :block/order "aY"]
  [13552 :block/page 13517]
  [13552 :block/parent 13550]
  [13552
   :block/title
   "b. Design and mitigation to improve compatibility."]
  [13552 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13552 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-7521-4787-a5f5-70331ce82d18"]
  [13553 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13553 :block/order "aZ"]
  [13553 :block/page 13517]
  [13553 :block/parent 13547]
  [13553
   :block/title
   "iv) Enable co-location of compatible infrastructure, including in infrastructure corridors."]
  [13553 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13553 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-8cbe-479e-beb2-4a3ba406f03b"]
  [13554 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13554 :block/order "aa"]
  [13554 :block/page 13517]
  [13554 :block/parent 13542]
  [13554 :block/title ""]
  [13554 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13554 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-faac-4cd4-a0aa-8ef3c071ca97"]
  [13555 :block/created-at 1792297890852]
  [13555 :block/order "ab"]
  [13555 :block/page 13517]
  [13555 :block/parent 13517]
  [13555
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 2.1:** must identify opportunities to improve New Zealand’s energy security, resilience, independence, and transition to a low carbon economy."]
  [13555 :block/updated-at 1792297890852]
  [13555 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44ba2-fb3f-4fc7-b1e3-1a0a1d10a633"]
  [13556 :block/created-at 1792297899566]
  [13556 :block/order "ac"]
  [13556 :block/page 13517]
  [13556 :block/parent 13517]
  [13556 :block/title ""]
  [13556 :block/updated-at 1792297899566]
  [13556 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bab-3c8a-4ddc-a694-57cd06417b84"]
  [13557 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13557 :block/order "ad"]
  [13557 :block/page 13517]
  [13557 :block/parent 13517]
  [13557 :block/title ""]
  [13557 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13557 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bab-ada8-4868-b7bd-5a5cdd486167"]
  [13558 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13558 :block/order "af"]
  [13558 :block/page 13517]
  [13558 :block/parent 13517]
  [13558
   :block/title
   "**INFR-Directive 2.2:** To maintain and improve energy security and resilience:"]
  [13558 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13558 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-b1a8-4b0d-97e2-abfc577ca211"]
  [13559 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13559 :block/order "ag"]
  [13559 :block/page 13517]
  [13559 :block/parent 13558]
  [13559
   :block/title
   "a)  and natural environment plans must enable all sources of energy to be developed and expanded, including thermal energy and emerging technologies."]
  [13559 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13559 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-f358-405b-acc9-2bb56ec3bb94"]
  [13560 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13560 :block/order "ah"]
  [13560 :block/page 13517]
  [13560 :block/parent 13558]
  [13560 :block/title "b) Natural environment plans must:"]
  [13560 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13560 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-75cf-48bd-8116-fc793cdc79d9"]
  [13561 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13561 :block/order "ai"]
  [13561 :block/page 13517]
  [13561 :block/parent 13560]
  [13561
   :block/title
   "i) Recognise the national significance of existing hydro-generation schemes [five national hydro-generation schemes currently in NPS-FM]."]
  [13561 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13561 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-546b-4465-b347-4fccf2e1b4eb"]
  [13562 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13562 :block/order "aj"]
  [13562 :block/page 13517]
  [13562 :block/parent 13560]
  [13562
   :block/title
   "ii) Protect the generation capacity and output of existing renewable energy assets when protecting, managing and allocating natural resources."]
  [13562 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13562 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-6c76-46b0-aec0-715c8b54f1c3"]
  [13563 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13563 :block/order "ak"]
  [13563 :block/page 13517]
  [13563 :block/parent 13558]
  [13563 :block/title ""]
  [13563 :block/updated-at 1792297900443]
  [13563 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44bac-9f1d-4b02-8baa-1ec524db3972"]
  [13564 :block/created-at 1792297900443]
  [13564 :block/order "al"]
  [13564 :block/page 13517]
  [13564 :block/parent 13517]
