   :block/title
   "m) Resource recovery facilities or waste disposal facilities, including emergency facilities and privately operated facilities that are open to the public."]
  [13626 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13626 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-6b55-44b4-8632-b5d4934c7297"]
  [13627 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13627 :block/order "aq"]
  [13627 :block/page 13575]
  [13627 :block/parent 13613]
  [13627
   :block/title
   "n) A network for the purpose of telecommunication as defined in section 5 of the Telecommunications Act 2001."]
  [13627 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13627 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-d450-4b8b-9c70-368c0647dc6a"]
  [13628 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13628 :block/order "ar"]
  [13628 :block/page 13575]
  [13628 :block/parent 13613]
  [13628
   :block/title
   "o) A network for the purpose of radiocommunication as defined in section 2(1) of the Radiocommunications Act 1989."]
  [13628 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13628 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ad46-4c70-ada3-7434e11ab411"]
  [13629 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13629 :block/order "as"]
  [13629 :block/page 13575]
  [13629 :block/parent 13613]
  [13629
   :block/title
   "p) The distribution, or storage and distribution, of water for the purpose of supply (including irrigation)."]
  [13629 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13629 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-cba6-4438-8618-e847522d05eb"]
  [13630 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13630 :block/order "at"]
  [13630 :block/page 13575]
  [13630 :block/parent 13613]
  [13630
   :block/title
   "q) A drainage or sewerage system, including a stormwater network."]
  [13630 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13630 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-d045-4391-a538-29e953735a2f"]
  [13631 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13631 :block/order "au"]
  [13631 :block/page 13575]
  [13631 :block/parent 13613]
  [13631
   :block/title
   "r) A road, railway line, cycleway, walkway, or similar facility (such as light rail, a busway, or a shared-use path)."]
  [13631 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13631 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-be82-4429-9eac-8c8514d8113f"]
  [13632 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13632 :block/order "av"]
  [13632 :block/page 13575]
  [13632 :block/parent 13613]
  [13632
   :block/title
   "s) A health facility operated by Health New Zealand to meet its obligations under the Pae Ora (Healthy Futures) Act 2022."]
  [13632 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13632 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-bf4e-4e63-b57d-360fdd46daaa"]
  [13633 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13633 :block/order "aw"]
  [13633 :block/page 13575]
  [13633 :block/parent 13613]
  [13633
   :block/title
   "t) Flood control and protection work carried out by, or on behalf of, a local authority."]
  [13633 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13633 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-9449-4d2b-a7be-4622733ddcdf"]
  [13635 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13635 :block/order "ay"]
  [13635 :block/page 13575]
  [13635 :block/parent 13575]
  [13635
   :block/title
   "Lawfully established activity is one that was established in accordance with the law or the planning rules that applied at the time. This is a well-established legal concept and generally means the activity continues to operate with the same or similar effects as when it was established."]
  [13635 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13635 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-e380-4b2a-9ca3-ba3e613e0cd1"]
  [13637 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13637 :block/order "b00"]
  [13637 :block/page 13575]
  [13637 :block/parent 13575]
  [13637
   :block/title
   "Minerals means a naturally occurring inorganic substance beneath or at the surface of the earth, whether or not under water; and includes all metallic minerals, non-metallic minerals, fuel minerals, precious stones, industrial rocks and building stones, and a prescribed substance within the meaning of the Atomic Energy Act 1945."]
  [13637 :block/updated-at 1792298177718]
  [13637 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-7cc4-435e-b2c0-737ee1c92aad"]
  [13639 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13639 :block/order "b02"]
  [13639 :block/page 13575]
  [13639 :block/parent 13575]
  [13639
   :block/title
   "Operational envelope means the horizontal and vertical space occupied by the physical infrastructure along with the surrounding area necessary to undertake routine operation and maintenance activities, ancillary infrastructure activities and associated access, including previously disturbed areas."]
  [13639 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13639 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-919b-45f6-bdc7-67d27ae378be"]
  [13641 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13641 :block/order "b04"]
  [13641 :block/page 13575]
  [13641 :block/parent 13575]
  [13641 :block/title "Primary production means:"]
  [13641 :block/updated-at 1792298193646]
  [13641 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-3f02-4bca-afb3-149f3cba5bae"]
  [13642 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13642 :block/order "b05"]
  [13642 :block/page 13575]
  [13642 :block/parent 13641]
  [13642
   :block/title
   "a) Any aquaculture, agricultural, pastoral, horticultural, mining, quarrying activities or forestry activities."]
  [13642 :block/updated-at 1792298211785]
  [13642 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ca28-4d02-8489-f05edfb25ae4"]
  [13643 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13643 :block/order "b06"]
  [13643 :block/page 13575]
  [13643 :block/parent 13641]
  [13643
   :block/title
   "b) Includes initial processing, as an ancillary activity, of commodities that result from the activities listed in (a)."]
  [13643 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13643 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-e4a9-48b7-aaa1-90107072c7c5"]
  [13644 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13644 :block/order "b07"]
  [13644 :block/page 13575]
  [13644 :block/parent 13641]
  [13644
   :block/title
   "c) Includes any land and buildings used for the production of the commodities from (a) and used for the initial processing of the commodities in (b)."]
  [13644 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13644 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ee82-47ff-bac8-8813caea8e90"]
  [13645 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13645 :block/order "b08"]
  [13645 :block/page 13575]
  [13645 :block/parent 13641]
  [13645
   :block/title
   "d) Excludes further processing of those commodities into a different product."]
  [13645 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13645 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-a370-4464-8a58-e62ce1c85fb8"]
  [13647 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13647 :block/order "b0A"]
  [13647 :block/page 13575]
  [13647 :block/parent 13575]
  [13647
   :block/title
   "Quarry means a location or area used for the permanent removal and extraction of aggregates (clay, silt, rock or sand). It includes the area of aggregate resource and surrounding land associated with the operation of a quarry and which is used for quarrying activities."]
  [13647 :block/updated-at 1792298234659]
  [13647 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ad8a-4777-91c4-607cb5463af9"]
  [13649 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13649 :block/order "b0C"]
  [13649 :block/page 13575]
  [13649 :block/parent 13575]
  [13649
   :block/title
   "Quarrying activities means the extraction, processing (including crushing, screening, washing, and blending), transport, storage, sale and recycling of aggregates (clay, silt, rock, sand), the deposition of overburden material, rehabilitation, landscaping and clean filling of the quarry, and the use of land and accessory buildings for offices, workshops and car parking areas associated with the operation of the quarry."]
  [13649 :block/updated-at 1792298245597]
  [13649 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-c8d7-47d6-b84f-63e6e9684a2e"]
  [13651 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13651 :block/order "b0E"]
  [13651 :block/page 13575]
  [13651 :block/parent 13575]
  [13651
   :block/title
   "Renewable energy means energy produced from solar, wind, hydro, geothermal, biomass, tidal, wave and ocean current sources [from RMA]."]
  [13651 :block/updated-at 1792298261579]
  [13651 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-8483-4545-8347-e7a7cf437e9c"]
  [13653 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13653 :block/order "b0G"]
  [13653 :block/page 13575]
  [13653 :block/parent 13575]
  [13653
   :block/title
   "Renewable energy system means the infrastructure networks and sites necessary for the generation, transmission, distribution and storage of renewable energy."]
  [13653 :block/updated-at 1792298268125]
  [13653 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-4d63-4e98-8c55-1a8f560fda0d"]
  [13655 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13655 :block/order "b0I"]
  [13655 :block/page 13575]
  [13655 :block/parent 13575]
  [13655 :block/title "Resource recovery facility means:"]
  [13655 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13655 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-870e-44c2-88b9-31d9c587225f"]
  [13656 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13656 :block/order "b0J"]
  [13656 :block/page 13575]
  [13656 :block/parent 13655]
  [13656 :block/title "a) A facility that:"]
  [13656 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13656 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-7cd8-4805-b16c-4ea1cbaa8e96"]
  [13657 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13657 :block/order "b0K"]
  [13657 :block/page 13575]
  [13657 :block/parent 13656]
  [13657
   :block/title
   "i) Collects, sorts, or processes material, or extracts materials or energy from material (or carries out any combination of those activities), for the purpose of recovering components for recycling or reuse."]
  [13657 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13657 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-75eb-464c-952f-a68ab5484754"]
  [13658 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13658 :block/order "b0L"]
  [13658 :block/page 13575]
  [13658 :block/parent 13656]
  [13658 :block/title "ii) Is not a disposal facility."]
  [13658 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13658 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-a3f4-4740-bcac-a31e84c5e646"]
  [13659 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13659 :block/order "b0M"]
  [13659 :block/page 13575]
  [13659 :block/parent 13656]
  [13659
   :block/title
   "iii) Does not incinerate waste (with or without energy recovery)."]
  [13659 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13659 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-5dcf-4535-a6bd-2b83816ba4f1"]
  [13660 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13660 :block/order "b0N"]
  [13660 :block/page 13575]
  [13660 :block/parent 13655]
  [13660
   :block/title
   "b) Includes a facility that is focused on a single waste stream, for example a construction and demolition resource recovery facility, or a large-scale composting operation and materials recovery facility."]
  [13660 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13660 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-2778-475f-84a9-34545e24f24e"]
  [13662 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13662 :block/order "b0P"]
  [13662 :block/page 13575]
  [13662 :block/parent 13575]
  [13662
   :block/title
   "Reverse sensitivity means the potential for an existing land use to be constrained by a new, or more intensive, sensitive activity and is location and context dependent."]
  [13662 :block/updated-at 1792298280911]
  [13662 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-fbe7-47b4-b40d-489074e7c824"]
  [13664 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13664 :block/order "b0R"]
  [13664 :block/page 13575]
  [13664 :block/parent 13575]
  [13664
   :block/title
   "Well-functioning urban area means an urban area that:"]
  [13664 :block/updated-at 1792298288248]
  [13664 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-0144-4cb7-b7ac-741cae42c7e2"]
  [13665 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13665 :block/order "b0S"]
  [13665 :block/page 13575]
  [13665 :block/parent 13664]
  [13665
   :block/title
   "a) Enables a range of homes that meet demand and needs of different households and provide choices in terms of type and location."]
  [13665 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13665 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-7a0d-45cf-a3a8-42ea7b2bff85"]
  [13666 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13666 :block/order "b0T"]
  [13666 :block/page 13575]
  [13666 :block/parent 13664]
  [13666 :block/title "b) Has good accessibility for people between:"]
  [13666 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13666 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-8b0f-432d-95c2-5822b4cbe237"]
  [13667 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13667 :block/order "b0U"]
  [13667 :block/page 13575]
  [13667 :block/parent 13664]
  [13667
   :block/title
   "i) Housing, workplaces, commercial and community services, natural spaces and open spaces, including by public and active transport."]
  [13667 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13667 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-f672-4db4-86bf-7fd30a1e2595"]
  [13668 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13668 :block/order "b0V"]
  [13668 :block/page 13575]
  [13668 :block/parent 13664]
  [13668
   :block/title
   "ii) Housing and local commercial and community services by walking."]
  [13668 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13668 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-1c73-416e-baa8-9d254a6b2cec"]
  [13669 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13669 :block/order "b0W"]
  [13669 :block/page 13575]
  [13669 :block/parent 13664]
  [13669
   :block/title
   "c) Enables efficient use of public and private investments."]
  [13669 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13669 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-2e53-499a-ba04-8386b79b2598"]
  [13670 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13670 :block/order "b0X"]
  [13670 :block/page 13575]
  [13670 :block/parent 13664]
  [13670
   :block/title
   "d) Enables a variety of sites that are suitable for different business sectors in terms of location and size."]
  [13670 :block/updated-at 1792298300852]
  [13670 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-3b3a-493c-99bd-4a09a05e09d3"]
  [13672 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13672 :block/order "b0Z"]
  [13672 :block/page 13575]
  [13672 :block/parent 13575]
  [13672
   :block/title
   "Well-functioning rural area means a rural area that:"]
  [13672 :block/updated-at 1792298296749]
  [13672 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ac6e-4ee0-9be5-324eaf829c31"]
  [13673 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13673 :block/order "b0a"]
  [13673 :block/page 13575]
  [13673 :block/parent 13672]
  [13673
   :block/title
   "a) Provides opportunities for a range of housing types in different locations, including where required to support rural businesses."]
  [13673 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13673 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-7405-4b36-8839-cb9e62398051"]
  [13674 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13674 :block/order "b0b"]
  [13674 :block/page 13575]
  [13674 :block/parent 13672]
  [13674
   :block/title
   "b) Provides rural communities with reliable access to workplaces, services and recreation."]
  [13674 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13674 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-7f1c-4823-a906-54d70403b359"]
  [13675 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13675 :block/order "b0c"]
  [13675 :block/page 13575]
  [13675 :block/parent 13672]
  [13675
   :block/title
   "c) Enables efficient use of public and private investments."]
  [13675 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13675 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-573c-4e64-88c6-182fea604c14"]
  [13676 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13676 :block/order "b0d"]
  [13676 :block/page 13575]
  [13676 :block/parent 13672]
  [13676
   :block/title
   "d) Enables efficient movement of people and goods."]
  [13676 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13676 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-2957-43e6-b5c7-9a0280ccffac"]
  [13677 :block/created-at 1792298043734]
  [13677 :block/order "b0e"]
  [13677 :block/page 13575]
  [13677 :block/parent 13672]
  [13677
   :block/title
   "e) Supports a range of rural land uses and compatible activities."]
  [13677 :block/updated-at 1792298043734]
  [13677 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44c3b-ea91-4974-8f51-1313365ff03b"]
  [13680 :block/created-at 1792298408236]
  [13680 :block/name "npd 03 primary production and the rural economy"]
  [13680 :block/refs 4]
  [13680 :block/refs 25]
  [13680 :block/refs 13516]
  [13680 :block/tags 4]
  [13680 :block/tags 13516]
  [13680
   :block/title
   "NPD 03 Primary production and the rural economy"]
  [13680 :block/updated-at 1792348329934]
  [13680 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da8-61d2-43a4-b904-ba461e8ff530"]
  [13681 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13681 :block/order "a0"]
  [13681 :block/page 13680]
  [13681 :block/parent 13680]
  [13681
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.1: Agriculture and associated activities are enabled and managed through a proportionate and risk-based approach, so that adverse effects on the environment and human health are addressed appropriately, including by:"]
  [13681 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13681 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da8-45d0-44c5-a7dc-7f4d3a6605af"]
  [13682 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13682 :block/order "a2"]
  [13682 :block/page 13680]
  [13682 :block/parent 13681]
  [13682
   :block/title
   "a) Land use plans and natural environment plans enabling agricultural land use, and associated supporting activities and practices, including drain maintenance, aggregate extraction, tracking, effluent storage and management, pasture management, fertiliser application and on-farm water storage [and in accordance with national standards]."]
  [13682 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13682 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-5a0f-4c7c-aa24-5678938c035f"]
  [13683 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13683 :block/order "a3"]
  [13683 :block/page 13680]
  [13683 :block/parent 13681]
  [13683
   :block/title
   "b) Any controls on agriculture activities being proportionate to environmental or human health risk."]
  [13683 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13683 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-72a9-492c-ab17-2ab1a5f17743"]
  [13685 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13685 :block/order "a5"]
  [13685 :block/page 13680]
  [13685 :block/parent 13680]
  [13685
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.2: Freshwater farm plans are the primary mechanism for identifying and managing the effects of on-farm activities on freshwater and freshwater ecosystems at the property scale. Natural environment plans must not, unless authorised by a national standard:"]
  [13685 :block/updated-at 1792298426766]
  [13685 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-b8ee-4f7a-8c0e-3d1d52c979cb"]
  [13686 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13686 :block/order "a6"]
  [13686 :block/page 13680]
  [13686 :block/parent 13685]
  [13686
   :block/title
   "a) Duplicate requirements for managing effects [eg, by requiring a permit] that are already addressed through a freshwater farm plan."]
  [13686 :block/updated-at 1792298449581]
  [13686 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-0c61-455a-8ea9-690409dbe4a0"]
  [13687 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13687 :block/order "a7"]
  [13687 :block/page 13680]
  [13687 :block/parent 13685]
  [13687
   :block/title
   "b) Require additional permits, approvals or controls unless an environmental limit has been, or is likely to be, breached and these are required by an Action Plan."]
  [13687 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13687 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-a3a8-4162-843f-916e5ee00ce7"]
  [13688 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13688 :block/order "a8"]
  [13688 :block/page 13680]
  [13688 :block/parent 13685]
  [13688
   :block/title
   "c) Impose stricter controls on farming activities than those set by the relevant national standard."]
  [13688 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13688 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-d50a-4930-80a4-90932527e5d4"]
  [13689 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13689 :block/order "a9"]
  [13689 :block/page 13680]
  [13689 :block/parent 13685]
  [13689 :block/title ""]
  [13689 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13689 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-2db7-41ba-991d-f3e002d38c88"]
  [13690 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13690 :block/order "aA"]
  [13690 :block/page 13680]
  [13690 :block/parent 13680]
  [13690
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.3: Where an environmental limit is breached or is likely to be breached, the council:"]
  [13690 :block/updated-at 1792298456663]
  [13690 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-4da5-47df-948b-b74a0f3f52d5"]
  [13691 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13691 :block/order "aB"]
  [13691 :block/page 13680]
  [13691 :block/parent 13690]
  [13691
   :block/title
   "a) Must develop an action plan to remedy the breach by a set target date."]
  [13691 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13691 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-6212-43c2-8220-93158003d28d"]
  [13692 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13692 :block/order "aC"]
  [13692 :block/page 13680]
  [13692 :block/parent 13690]
  [13692
   :block/title
   "b) Must ensure there is an enforceable mechanism (which may include freshwater farm plans, action plans, rules, and expansion of existing catchment programmes) to remedy the breach by a set target date or interim limit."]
  [13692 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13692 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-5c81-472f-bcc2-c2c7bf1b692d"]
  [13693 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13693 :block/order "aD"]
  [13693 :block/page 13680]
  [13693 :block/parent 13690]
  [13693
   :block/title
   "c) May allow existing activities to continue where they are able to reduce relevant environmental impacts in accordance with the mechanism and target date or interim limit."]
  [13693 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13693 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-1532-43db-aebd-eaabbe73bacb"]
  [13694 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13694 :block/order "aE"]
  [13694 :block/page 13680]
  [13694 :block/parent 13690]
  [13694 :block/title ""]
  [13694 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13694 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-b5e1-41d1-a8ca-f76073d1f8d1"]
  [13695 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13695 :block/order "aF"]
  [13695 :block/page 13680]
  [13695 :block/parent 13680]
  [13695
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.4: To support secure, reliable and resilient water supply for existing and future primary production, including stock drinking water:"]
  [13695 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13695 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-07b6-4d4f-8eac-63aee1173731"]
  [13696 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13696 :block/order "aG"]
  [13696 :block/page 13680]
  [13696 :block/parent 13695]
  [13696
   :block/title
   "a) Natural environment plans must enable allocation of sustainably available water and require efficient water use."]
  [13696 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13696 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-5ecf-45be-845b-9d56df67a77b"]
  [13697 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13697 :block/order "aH"]
  [13697 :block/page 13680]
  [13697 :block/parent 13695]
  [13697
   :block/title
   "b) Land use plans and natural environment plans must provide for the taking and storage of water during periods of high flow."]
  [13697 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13697 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-5ed8-41f2-a9e2-78e1c36e593c"]
  [13698 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13698 :block/order "aI"]
  [13698 :block/page 13680]
  [13698 :block/parent 13695]
  [13698 :block/title ""]
  [13698 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13698 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-b680-4d92-a15d-9d259ebdcfd0"]
  [13699 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13699 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13699 :block/page 13680]
  [13699 :block/parent 13680]
  [13699
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.5: To enable the construction, operation, maintenance and use of constructed wetlands within  rural production environments [in accordance with national standards]:"]
  [13699 :block/updated-at 1792298482985]
  [13699 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-f98e-428a-b998-b3d382023198"]
  [13700 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13700 :block/order "aK"]
  [13700 :block/page 13680]
  [13700 :block/parent 13699]
  [13700
   :block/title
   "a) Land use plans and natural environment plans must enable and provide for constructed wetlands for the following purposes (including in combination):"]
  [13700 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13700 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-cf33-4bba-ba7f-16d8907e60a1"]
  [13701 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13701 :block/order "aL"]
  [13701 :block/page 13680]
  [13701 :block/parent 13700]
  [13701
   :block/title
   "i) Water quality improvement, including sediment retention and nutrient management."]
  [13701 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13701 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-58ce-4a0d-8276-684fced723c3"]
  [13702 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13702 :block/order "aM"]
  [13702 :block/page 13680]
  [13702 :block/parent 13700]
  [13702
   :block/title
   "ii) Stormwater attenuation and flood mitigation."]
  [13702 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13702 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-4563-4e43-82bc-6ccc18837a68"]
  [13703 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13703 :block/order "aN"]
  [13703 :block/page 13680]
  [13703 :block/parent 13700]
  [13703
   :block/title
   "iii) Wastewater treatment (including farm or community-scale treatment), where effects are appropriately managed."]
  [13703 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13703 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-99af-489a-9059-78b0a6de6d52"]
  [13704 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13704 :block/order "aO"]
  [13704 :block/page 13680]
  [13704 :block/parent 13700]
  [13704
   :block/title
   "iv) Other edge-of-field mitigation and environmental enhancement projects that deliver measurable improvements to freshwater outcomes."]
  [13704 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13704 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-cd09-4858-abe1-61b47504706b"]
  [13705 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13705 :block/order "aP"]
  [13705 :block/page 13680]
  [13705 :block/parent 13699]
  [13705
   :block/title
   "b) Natural environment plans must provide for water takes and discharges related to constructed wetlands where necessary and appropriate."]
  [13705 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13705 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-bb13-4720-b0d8-113e8d132fb1"]
  [13706 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13706 :block/order "aQ"]
  [13706 :block/page 13680]
  [13706 :block/parent 13699]
  [13706 :block/title ""]
  [13706 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13706 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-9a47-46c1-bf2a-868f0f1f7c69"]
  [13707 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13707 :block/order "aR"]
  [13707 :block/page 13680]
  [13707 :block/parent 13680]
  [13707
   :block/title
   "PP-Directive 1.6: To ensure primary production activities can continue operating and adapting without unreasonable constraint from reverse sensitivity effects, land use plans must:"]
  [13707 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13707 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-daf1-4e19-8fd3-b29238ee81e1"]
  [13708 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13708 :block/order "aS"]
  [13708 :block/page 13680]
  [13708 :block/parent 13707]
  [13708
   :block/title
   "a) Recognise primary production as the leading and expected land use within rural production zones."]
  [13708 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13708 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-9724-4404-8378-9946ff9a057e"]
  [13709 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13709 :block/order "aT"]
  [13709 :block/page 13680]
  [13709 :block/parent 13707]
  [13709
   :block/title
   "b) Use a range of planning tools and methods to separate incompatible land uses in rural areas where practicable, including by:"]
  [13709 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13709 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-d49e-4734-94ea-e8bfde200a93"]
  [13710 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13710 :block/order "aU"]
  [13710 :block/page 13680]
  [13710 :block/parent 13709]
  [13710
   :block/title
   "i) Directing rural lifestyle, rural settlements and sensitive or incompatible activities to appropriate locations."]
  [13710 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13710 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-52d7-41b5-81db-4b83ba683f6f"]
  [13711 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13711 :block/order "aV"]
  [13711 :block/page 13680]
  [13711 :block/parent 13709]
  [13711
   :block/title
   "ii) Limiting the establishment or intensification of incompatible activities within rural production zones as necessary to protect primary production activities from unreasonable constraint."]
  [13711 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13711 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-dc31-42ff-beb5-80637f4b9cca"]
  [13712 :block/created-at 1792298409988]
  [13712 :block/order "aW"]
  [13712 :block/page 13680]
  [13712 :block/parent 13707]
  [13712
   :block/title
   "c) Where new or intensified incompatible activities are proposed in proximity to existing primary production, require those activities to avoid or mitigate reverse sensitivity effects so primary production can continue to operate effectively and efficiently, including through appropriate location, design, buffers and any mitigation measures."]
  [13712 :block/updated-at 1792298409988]
  [13712 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44da9-dea6-47d1-a793-aa3a116c768f"]
  [13713 :block/created-at 1792298516964]
  [13713 :block/name "npd 04 resources - quarrying, mining and waste"]
  [13713 :block/refs 4]
  [13713 :block/refs 25]
  [13713 :block/refs 13516]
  [13713 :block/tags 4]
  [13713 :block/tags 13516]
  [13713 :block/title "NPD 04 Resources - Quarrying, Mining and Waste"]
  [13713 :block/updated-at 1792348341403]
  [13713 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e14-9d2c-4ba9-adc7-ae9af848ac3c"]
  [13714 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13714 :block/order "a0"]
  [13714 :block/page 13713]
  [13714 :block/parent 13713]
  [13714
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.1: To enable quarrying and mining activities to meet existing and future demand while managing unreasonable effects on people and the environment:"]
  [13714 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13714 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e15-8ef4-403c-80aa-58850243117b"]
  [13715 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13715 :block/order "a2"]
  [13715 :block/page 13713]
  [13715 :block/parent 13714]
  [13715
   :block/title
   "a) Land use plans and natural environment plans must:"]
  [13715 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13715 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-e7e6-4736-9162-af1589e1ffea"]
  [13716 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13716 :block/order "a3"]
  [13716 :block/page 13713]
  [13716 :block/parent 13715]
  [13716
   :block/title
   "i) Enable new quarrying, mining, associated infrastructure, ancillary activities, rehabilitation, and ongoing operations in identified locations, subject to effects being appropriately managed."]
  [13716 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13716 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-4ff1-43dd-a132-8b2f53a40fc7"]
  [13717 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13717 :block/order "a4"]
  [13717 :block/page 13713]
  [13717 :block/parent 13715]
  [13717
   :block/title
   "ii) Provide for the expansion of existing quarries and mines where necessary to maintain supply of mineral resources, subject to effects being appropriately managed."]
  [13717 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13717 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-0340-45f9-b72b-8c044dd96740"]
  [13718 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13718 :block/order "a5"]
  [13718 :block/page 13713]
  [13718 :block/parent 13714]
  [13718
   :block/title
   "b) Land use plans must manage the adverse effects of quarrying and mining activities to avoid unreasonable effects on others."]
  [13718 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13718 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-3d38-4450-9925-301f889567f7"]
  [13719 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13719 :block/order "a6"]
  [13719 :block/page 13713]
  [13719 :block/parent 13714]
  [13719
   :block/title
   "c) Natural environment plans must enable quarrying and mining activities by managing environmental and human health effects, including through measures necessary to achieve environmental outcomes and environmental limits."]
  [13719 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13719 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-9a43-4c44-b110-3f026220f68a"]
  [13720 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13720 :block/order "a7"]
  [13720 :block/page 13713]
  [13720 :block/parent 13714]
  [13720 :block/title ""]
  [13720 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13720 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-f346-4977-bf89-6e6affd2adf0"]
  [13721 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13721 :block/order "a8"]
  [13721 :block/page 13713]
  [13721 :block/parent 13713]
  [13721
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.2: To identify regionally significant mineral resources (including gravel in rivers and streams) and provide for their protection from competing land uses:"]
  [13721 :block/updated-at 1792298557993]
  [13721 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-0617-4b18-8aef-21c3d90c6996"]
  [13722 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13722 :block/order "a9"]
  [13722 :block/page 13713]
  [13722 :block/parent 13721]
  [13722
   :block/title
   "a) Spatial plans must identify existing regionally significant quarries and mines, and potential new regionally significant mineral resources."]
  [13722 :block/updated-at 1792298575000]
  [13722 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-c445-40a7-a0a0-e1a6cfaf5d45"]
  [13723 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13723 :block/order "aA"]
  [13723 :block/page 13713]
  [13723 :block/parent 13721]
  [13723
   :block/title
   "b) Land use plans must protect identified regionally significant quarries, mines and mineral resources from competing land uses, including urban development and infrastructure, except where the infrastructure has an operational or functional need to locate within or near the resource and adverse effects on the continued operation, use, development, or expansion of the quarry, mine, or mineral resource are managed."]
  [13723 :block/updated-at 1792298586373]
  [13723 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-5309-43c1-81a6-4c6a696a98ab"]
  [13725 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13725 :block/order "aC"]
  [13725 :block/page 13713]
  [13725 :block/parent 13713]
  [13725
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.3: To support improved environmental outcomes over the life of a quarry or mine, land use plans and natural environment plans must:"]
  [13725 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13725 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-7ef1-4ecd-9f1c-ed0b53aed242"]
  [13726 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13726 :block/order "aD"]
  [13726 :block/page 13713]
  [13726 :block/parent 13725]
  [13726
   :block/title
   "a) Provide for progressive rehabilitation, including restoration, offsetting, and agreed post-extraction land uses, where these contribute to improved environmental outcomes."]
  [13726 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13726 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-26e2-47be-9beb-22c2254a2ff8"]
  [13727 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13727 :block/order "aE"]
  [13727 :block/page 13713]
  [13727 :block/parent 13725]
  [13727
   :block/title
   "b) Avoid imposing unnecessary constraints on rehabilitation activities and the achievement of agreed post-extraction outcomes."]
  [13727 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13727 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-01eb-4980-a16b-4a3dcc791d19"]
  [13728 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13728 :block/order "aF"]
  [13728 :block/page 13713]
  [13728 :block/parent 13725]
  [13728 :block/title ""]
  [13728 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13728 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-ef51-46ce-bc29-949548229863"]
  [13729 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13729 :block/order "aG"]
  [13729 :block/page 13713]
  [13729 :block/parent 13713]
  [13729
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.4: To provide for the long-term availability and extraction of identified mineral resources that are necessary to support infrastructure, development and economic wellbeing, land use plans must:"]
  [13729 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13729 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-7f96-487c-a667-8b8fcbfaa8f2"]
  [13730 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13730 :block/order "aH"]
  [13730 :block/page 13713]
  [13730 :block/parent 13729]
  [13730
   :block/title
   "a) Avoid locating urban development where it would prevent the extraction of identified mineral resources, unless there is no feasible alternative to meet development capacity requirements."]
  [13730 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13730 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-e68d-4ffc-9d4a-056977200697"]
  [13731 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13731 :block/order "aI"]
  [13731 :block/page 13713]
  [13731 :block/parent 13729]
  [13731
   :block/title
   "b) Require new land uses to avoid or mitigate adverse effects on the extraction of the identified mineral resource."]
  [13731 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13731 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-5c0b-48d7-a08d-fb3b8710bae9"]
  [13732 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13732 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13732 :block/page 13713]
  [13732 :block/parent 13729]
  [13732
   :block/title
   "c) Where conflict cannot be avoided, prioritise the long-term availability of known significant mineral resources where these are necessary to support infrastructure, development and economic wellbeing."]
  [13732 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13732 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-2dff-4c98-be40-51ccfeff74cc"]
  [13733 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13733 :block/order "aK"]
  [13733 :block/page 13713]
  [13733 :block/parent 13729]
  [13733 :block/title ""]
  [13733 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13733 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-0a9e-4540-97dc-556b072519f4"]
  [13734 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13734 :block/order "aL"]
  [13734 :block/page 13713]
  [13734 :block/parent 13713]
  [13734
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.5: To manage adverse effects of quarrying and mining activities, including associated activities, on freshwater and the coastal marine area, natural environment plans must manage the negative effects on the natural environment in accordance with national standards."]
  [13734 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13734 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-2f59-43fb-9070-af08a535ed6a"]
  [13735 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13735 :block/order "aM"]
  [13735 :block/page 13713]
  [13735 :block/parent 13734]
  [13735 :block/title ""]
  [13735 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13735 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-9593-4b23-9a52-2ba4eacc32e6"]
  [13736 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13736 :block/order "aN"]
  [13736 :block/page 13713]
  [13736 :block/parent 13713]
  [13736
   :block/title
   "RW-Directive 1.6: To provide for the continued operation of quarries and mines while progressing towards the achievement of environmental limits, natural environment plans must:"]
  [13736 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13736 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-526f-4665-9968-84f058340ac8"]
  [13737 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13737 :block/order "aO"]
  [13737 :block/page 13713]
  [13737 :block/parent 13736]
  [13737
   :block/title
   "a) Provide pathways that enable quarries and mines to continue operating where environmental limits are breached, or are likely to be breached."]
  [13737 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13737 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-a56b-469f-a2d2-a7dfeb107d65"]
  [13738 :block/created-at 1792298539468]
  [13738 :block/order "aP"]
  [13738 :block/page 13713]
  [13738 :block/parent 13736]
  [13738
   :block/title
   "b) Ensure there is an enforceable mechanism to remedy the breach by a set target date."]
  [13738 :block/updated-at 1792298539468]
  [13738 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e2b-2252-4e74-9a3d-9a3d111bbc4a"]
  [13739 :block/created-at 1792298627461]
  [13739 :block/name "npd 05 public values"]
  [13739 :block/refs 4]
  [13739 :block/refs 25]
  [13739 :block/refs 13516]
  [13739 :block/tags 4]
  [13739 :block/tags 13516]
  [13739 :block/title "NPD 05 Public Values"]
  [13739 :block/updated-at 1792348352071]
  [13739 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e83-f526-4259-8b7a-1f3f6313b8a1"]
  [13740 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13740 :block/order "a0"]
  [13740 :block/page 13739]
  [13740 :block/parent 13739]
  [13740
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.1: To protect environmental health, and improve resilience, Natural environment plans must:"]
  [13740 :block/updated-at 1792298652224]
  [13740 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e83-31a8-4487-9b99-8db5f9c3dedd"]
  [13741 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13741 :block/order "a2"]
  [13741 :block/page 13739]
  [13741 :block/parent 13740]
  [13741
   :block/title
   "a) Set ecosystem health limits in accordance with the methodology in national standards, ensuring that these are at or above any relevant minimum acceptable level unless provided for in a justification report."]
  [13741 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13741 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-200e-4fa5-bb4f-c6d211b9ac9e"]
  [13742 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13742 :block/order "a3"]
  [13742 :block/page 13739]
  [13742 :block/parent 13740]
  [13742
   :block/title
   "b) Utilise a range of methods to protect the natural environment and its ecosystem services that prioritise non-regulatory support (such as community and landowner enhancement projects) but also include rules where appropriate."]
  [13742 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13742 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-80a6-4733-a3ea-f47f8cc7b438"]
  [13743 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13743 :block/order "a4"]
  [13743 :block/page 13739]
  [13743 :block/parent 13740]
  [13743
   :block/title
   "c) Identify areas where coordinated investments are desirable to restore resilience or ecosystem services that will deliver social or economic benefits, including degraded ecosystems, catchments or wetlands."]
  [13743 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13743 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-f60a-4fad-b9b9-d063566137b3"]
  [13744 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13744 :block/order "a5"]
  [13744 :block/page 13739]
  [13744 :block/parent 13740]
  [13744
   :block/title
   "d) Recognise where ecosystem services can mitigate effects and risks and enable nature-based solutions in urban and rural areas [eg, wetlands to mitigate flooding, absorb contaminants and provide for recreation]"]
  [13744 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13744 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-cfcf-45b7-ae29-3d5557f8c366"]
  [13745 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13745 :block/order "a6"]
  [13745 :block/page 13739]
  [13745 :block/parent 13740]
  [13745 :block/title ""]
  [13745 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13745 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-5d81-41e1-b324-13c65e42fd62"]
  [13746 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13746 :block/order "a7"]
  [13746 :block/page 13739]
  [13746 :block/parent 13739]
  [13746
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.2: Land use plans and Natural environment plans must enable the construction, operation, maintenance and renewal of constructed wetlands used primarily for contaminant treatment, stormwater management, wastewater treatment, sediment retention, nutrient attenuation or other water management purposes [in accordance with national standards]."]
  [13746 :block/updated-at 1792298679474]
  [13746 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-47c5-4587-87cc-29a7dee1b662"]
  [13747 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13747 :block/order "a8"]
  [13747 :block/page 13739]
  [13747 :block/parent 13746]
  [13747 :block/title ""]
  [13747 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13747 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-8c4a-4ae3-9ecc-0e2163742e40"]
  [13748 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13748 :block/order "a9"]
  [13748 :block/page 13739]
  [13748 :block/parent 13739]
  [13748
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.3: To protect human health and support the resilience of communities, Natural environment plans must:"]
  [13748 :block/updated-at 1792298687984]
  [13748 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-08f2-47f6-a5fe-6f3f339ee56e"]
  [13749 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13749 :block/order "aA"]
  [13749 :block/page 13739]
  [13749 :block/parent 13748]
  [13749 :block/title "a) Ensure human health limits are met."]
  [13749 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13749 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-50c7-413c-a3b0-5db9c024af89"]
  [13750 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13750 :block/order "aB"]
  [13750 :block/page 13739]
  [13750 :block/parent 13748]
  [13750
   :block/title
   "b) Proactively manage land use (including contaminant pathways) and activities that generate, discharge or transport contaminants:"]
  [13750 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13750 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-1938-45ef-97f0-3a96a80dd20f"]
  [13751 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13751 :block/order "aC"]
  [13751 :block/page 13739]
  [13751 :block/parent 13750]
  [13751
   :block/title
   "i) In a manner proportionate to the level of risk posed to human health identified in a health impact assessment."]
  [13751 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13751 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-884c-4864-867f-b5995d3b0c7c"]
  [13752 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13752 :block/order "aD"]
  [13752 :block/page 13739]
  [13752 :block/parent 13750]
  [13752
   :block/title
   "ii) Include reverse sensitivity considerations to manage exposure risk."]
  [13752 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13752 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-6225-4289-a6b8-edbd48b2de3d"]
  [13753 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13753 :block/order "aE"]
  [13753 :block/page 13739]
  [13753 :block/parent 13748]
  [13753
   :block/title
   "c) Protect air quality while taking into consideration home heating needs."]
  [13753 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13753 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-196c-4c02-b702-b8af70d1755f"]
  [13754 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13754 :block/order "aF"]
  [13754 :block/page 13739]
  [13754 :block/parent 13748]
  [13754
   :block/title
   "d) Manage legacy effects from past contamination, including groundwater and soil contamination where this creates a hazard to human health."]
  [13754 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13754 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-749f-4ae3-889f-815467053eec"]
  [13755 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13755 :block/order "aG"]
  [13755 :block/page 13739]
  [13755 :block/parent 13748]
  [13755 :block/title ""]
  [13755 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13755 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-7a66-4cf3-b811-4a8143667077"]
  [13756 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13756 :block/order "aH"]
  [13756 :block/page 13739]
  [13756 :block/parent 13739]
  [13756
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.4: To protect drinking water sources from contamination, natural environment plans must:"]
  [13756 :block/updated-at 1792298702156]
  [13756 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-03e1-495a-ad8b-fedb870cffc5"]
  [13757 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13757 :block/order "aI"]
  [13757 :block/page 13739]
  [13757 :block/parent 13756]
  [13757
   :block/title
   "a) Identify and map source water risk management areas for every registered drinking water supply serving over 100 people in a region."]
  [13757 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13757 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-7129-4592-9f36-dee756418aa5"]
  [13758 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13758 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13758 :block/page 13739]
  [13758 :block/parent 13756]
  [13758
   :block/title
   "b) Control discharges and other activities as needed to support compliance with drinking water standards after treatment."]
  [13758 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13758 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-a101-44c5-ad73-0da9b1caff27"]
  [13759 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13759 :block/order "aK"]
  [13759 :block/page 13739]
  [13759 :block/parent 13756]
  [13759 :block/title ""]
  [13759 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13759 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-22e7-40f6-8251-ef8b14341892"]
  [13760 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13760 :block/order "aL"]
  [13760 :block/page 13739]
  [13760 :block/parent 13739]
  [13760
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.5: To support and enable the enhancement of the natural environment, natural environment plans must:"]
  [13760 :block/updated-at 1792298714586]
  [13760 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-d974-4b9d-95c1-1f07b1d29c2e"]
  [13761 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13761 :block/order "aM"]
  [13761 :block/page 13739]
  [13761 :block/parent 13760]
  [13761
   :block/title
   "a) Identify and prioritise opportunities to enhance ecosystem health, resilience and ecosystem services."]
  [13761 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13761 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-fcc9-403d-a7c6-2f6f6be5cd96"]
  [13762 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13762 :block/order "aN"]
  [13762 :block/page 13739]
  [13762 :block/parent 13760]
  [13762
   :block/title
   "b) Utilise a range of regulatory and non-regulatory methods to support environmental enhancement, including incentives, stewardship programmes and community-led projects."]
  [13762 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13762 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-89c9-4619-bde6-6da4c1f599c8"]
  [13763 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13763 :block/order "aO"]
  [13763 :block/page 13739]
  [13763 :block/parent 13760]
  [13763
   :block/title
   "c) Support nature-based solutions and projects that deliver environmental co-benefits."]
  [13763 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13763 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-7c34-4281-9b85-b53a56f0dafe"]
  [13764 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13764 :block/order "aP"]
  [13764 :block/page 13739]
  [13764 :block/parent 13760]
  [13764 :block/title ""]
  [13764 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13764 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-f114-4485-96dd-68a46c05fec6"]
  [13765 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13765 :block/order "aQ"]
  [13765 :block/page 13739]
  [13765 :block/parent 13739]
  [13765
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.6: To support the development and implementation of the natural environment plan provisions and biodiversity strategy, councils should identify sites and opportunities that are suitable candidates for restoration and enhancement of the environment, including sites suitable for offsetting and compensation."]
  [13765 :block/updated-at 1792298734764]
  [13765 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-6bc5-4bb7-a6e0-00a428d91609"]
  [13766 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13766 :block/order "aR"]
  [13766 :block/page 13739]
  [13766 :block/parent 13765]
  [13766 :block/title ""]
  [13766 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13766 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-46ec-4847-ad95-d1f874e64c44"]
  [13767 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13767 :block/order "aS"]
  [13767 :block/page 13739]
  [13767 :block/parent 13739]
  [13767
   :block/title
   "PV-Directive 1.7: To enable the use and development of natural resources, natural environment plans must:"]
  [13767 :block/updated-at 1792298744810]
  [13767 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-dfb0-47ab-9abf-1dfe118aab6e"]
  [13768 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13768 :block/order "aT"]
  [13768 :block/page 13739]
  [13768 :block/parent 13767]
  [13768
   :block/title
   "a) Provide for essential human health needs such as community drinking water supply."]
  [13768 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13768 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-6168-4eca-a198-6960ffd67e3f"]
  [13769 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13769 :block/order "aU"]
  [13769 :block/page 13739]
  [13769 :block/parent 13767]
  [13769
   :block/title
   "b) Ensure the use and development of natural resources does not unreasonably affect others, including existing resource users and receiving environments."]
  [13769 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13769 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-be6c-4a77-811c-e08c674242ca"]
  [13770 :block/created-at 1792298639135]
  [13770 :block/order "aV"]
  [13770 :block/page 13739]
  [13770 :block/parent 13767]
  [13770
   :block/title
   "c) Recognise that some activities have a functional or operational need to locate in natural environments, including freshwater, the coastal environment, and their adjacent margins."]
  [13770 :block/updated-at 1792298639135]
  [13770 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44e8f-04ce-4698-8300-9020efde325d"]
  [13771 :block/created-at 1792298775038]
  [13771 :block/name "npd system-wide directives"]
  [13771 :block/refs 4]
  [13771 :block/refs 25]
  [13771 :block/refs 13516]
  [13771 :block/tags 4]
  [13771 :block/tags 13516]
  [13771 :block/title "NPD System-wide Directives"]
  [13771 :block/updated-at 1792348303268]
  [13771 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f17-f310-48a2-8a03-184bb7cc1b45"]
  [13772 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13772 :block/order "a0"]
  [13772 :block/page 13771]
  [13772 :block/parent 13771]
  [13772 :block/title "Māori Interests"]
  [13772 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13772 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f17-29b0-4469-b125-71f8ddd55df2"]
  [13773 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13773 :block/order "a2"]
  [13773 :block/page 13771]
  [13773 :block/parent 13772]
  [13773
   :block/title
   "SW-Directive 1.1: When preparing regional spatial plans, land use plans and natural environment plans, decision-makers must:"]
  [13773 :block/updated-at 1792298805700]
  [13773 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-2395-42f8-9662-625d5397ed99"]
  [13774 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13774 :block/order "a3"]
  [13774 :block/page 13771]
  [13774 :block/parent 13773]
  [13774
   :block/title
   "a) Identify Treaty settlement redress or arrangements relevant to the area."]
  [13774 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13774 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-4ea2-4dce-98a5-36c150d59be9"]
  [13775 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13775 :block/order "a4"]
  [13775 :block/page 13771]
  [13775 :block/parent 13773]
  [13775
   :block/title
   "b) Establish whether any agreement has been reached between the Crown and the relevant PSGE(s) on how that Treaty settlement redress or arrangements will operate under the Natural Environment Bill and Planning Bill under clause 9."]
  [13775 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13775 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-7b6d-44df-956c-1c744b314040"]
  [13776 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13776 :block/order "a5"]
  [13776 :block/page 13771]
  [13776 :block/parent 13773]
  [13776
   :block/title
   "c) Where no agreement has been reached, ensure that, in line with clause 10 of the Natural Environment Bill and Planning Bill, any Treaty settlement redress or arrangements are given an effect that is the same or equivalent as the effect they had under the Resource Management Act 1991 to the greatest extent possible under the Natural Environment Bill and Planning Bill."]
  [13776 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13776 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-c39e-4ca5-83d1-99654aa5616c"]
  [13777 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13777 :block/order "a6"]
  [13777 :block/page 13771]
  [13777 :block/parent 13773]
  [13777 :block/title ""]
  [13777 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13777 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-574b-4053-afee-6bb481ad0ad6"]
  [13778 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13778 :block/order "a7"]
  [13778 :block/page 13771]
  [13778 :block/parent 13772]
  [13778
   :block/title
   "SW-Directive 1.2: Engagement with Māori groups in the development of regional spatial plans, land use plans and natural environment plans must be undertaken in accordance with statutory requirements and national standards."]
  [13778 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13778 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-afa6-4fbb-99b7-056a7e34750d"]
  [13779 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13779 :block/order "a8"]
  [13779 :block/page 13771]
  [13779 :block/parent 13772]
  [13779 :block/title ""]
  [13779 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13779 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-43e2-4334-9f1e-42bb8ba7db05"]
  [13780 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13780 :block/order "a9"]
  [13780 :block/page 13771]
  [13780 :block/parent 13772]
  [13780
   :block/title
   "SW-Directive 1.3: To protect and provide for sites of significance to Māori [in accordance with national standards]:"]
  [13780 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13780 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-129f-4369-bd5f-ac72adfab5c6"]
  [13781 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13781 :block/order "aA"]
  [13781 :block/page 13771]
  [13781 :block/parent 13780]
  [13781
   :block/title
   "a) Regional spatial plans must consider how options for growth and change can best provide for identified sites of significance to Māori by avoiding strategic growth, development, land and resource use, and infrastructure in locations that would undermine the values Māori associate with those sites."]
  [13781 :block/updated-at 1792298817704]
  [13781 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-4112-4367-900c-abfff12ed462"]
  [13782 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13782 :block/order "aB"]
  [13782 :block/page 13771]
  [13782 :block/parent 13780]
  [13782
   :block/title
   "b) Land use plans and natural environment plans must:"]
  [13782 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13782 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-5977-4b31-83b9-295f94fc9edb"]
  [13783 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13783 :block/order "aC"]
  [13783 :block/page 13771]
  [13783 :block/parent 13782]
  [13783
   :block/title
   "i) Identify and protect sites of significance to Māori by mapping or otherwise identifying those sites."]
  [13783 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13783 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-2880-46c8-8b7f-112cc068af03"]
  [13784 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13784 :block/order "aD"]
  [13784 :block/page 13771]
  [13784 :block/parent 13782]
  [13784
   :block/title
   "ii) Manage adverse effects on identified sites of significance to Māori."]
  [13784 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13784 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-d685-4280-8200-7d880f33a6d1"]
  [13785 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13785 :block/order "aE"]
  [13785 :block/page 13771]
  [13785 :block/parent 13782]
  [13785
   :block/title
   "iii) Ensure that any environmental limits are set in a way that protects identified sites of significance to Māori."]
  [13785 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13785 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-2d89-4842-800e-20a018fe2f96"]
  [13786 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13786 :block/order "aF"]
  [13786 :block/page 13771]
  [13786 :block/parent 13780]
  [13786
   :block/title
   "c) Regional spatial plans, land use plans and natural environment plans must only include sites of significance that meet evidential requirements."]
  [13786 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13786 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-395a-4638-bd72-06629dcc307a"]
  [13787 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13787 :block/order "aG"]
  [13787 :block/page 13771]
  [13787 :block/parent 13780]
  [13787 :block/title ""]
  [13787 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13787 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-6623-4b22-8887-9c7d6ef427a3"]
  [13788 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13788 :block/order "aH"]
  [13788 :block/page 13771]
  [13788 :block/parent 13772]
  [13788
   :block/title
   "SW-Directive 1.4: To support the development of identified Māori land [in accordance with national standards]:"]
  [13788 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13788 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-8206-4aa3-b561-e03caf1909b5"]
  [13789 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13789 :block/order "aI"]
  [13789 :block/page 13771]
  [13789 :block/parent 13788]
  [13789
   :block/title
   "a) Regional spatial plans must identify strategic opportunities where development and infrastructure investment can occur."]
  [13789 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13789 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-1205-45d1-b34f-249cb7e300f8"]
  [13790 :block/created-at 1792298784443]
  [13790 :block/order "aJ"]
  [13790 :block/page 13771]
  [13790 :block/parent 13788]
  [13790 :block/title "b) Land use plans and natural"]
  [13790 :block/updated-at 1792298784443]
  [13790 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f20-f358-4ffe-887a-cdc7495bb309"]
  [13791 :block/created-at 1792298831656]
  [13791 :block/order "a1"]
  [13791 :block/page 13771]
  [13791 :block/parent 13771]
  [13791 :block/title ""]
  [13791 :block/updated-at 1792298831656]
  [13791 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f4f-b518-4d7c-bb6c-e6824465a223"]
  [13792 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13792 :block/order "a2"]
  [13792 :block/page 13771]
  [13792 :block/parent 13771]
  [13792 :block/title "**Natural Hazards**"]
  [13792 :block/updated-at 1792298847405]
  [13792 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f51-d98c-4dd4-bf5f-61796ab5cb32"]
  [13793 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13793 :block/order "a4"]
  [13793 :block/page 13771]
  [13793 :block/parent 13792]
  [13793
   :block/title
   "**SW-Directive 2.1:** To safeguard against natural hazard risks and improve resilience, regional spatial plans must:"]
  [13793 :block/updated-at 1792298866192]
  [13793 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f57-b58f-468a-b512-89b220df78d7"]
  [13794 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13794 :block/order "a5"]
  [13794 :block/page 13771]
  [13794 :block/parent 13793]
  [13794
   :block/title
   "a) Direct housing growth, infrastructure, and investment towards areas where natural hazard risks can be avoided or mitigated."]
  [13794 :block/updated-at 1792298873391]
  [13794 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f57-e5bf-4120-b85e-36788a00d794"]
  [13795 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13795 :block/order "a6"]
  [13795 :block/page 13771]
  [13795 :block/parent 13793]
  [13795
   :block/title
   "b) Identify areas of existing development exposed to climate-related natural hazard events where adaptation planning should be prioritised."]
  [13795 :block/updated-at 1792298839891]
  [13795 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f57-dd9f-4e3a-a155-84e923cd28f7"]
  [13796 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13796 :block/order "a7"]
  [13796 :block/page 13771]
  [13796 :block/parent 13792]
  [13796
   :block/title
   "**SW-Directive 2.2:** To ensure activities do not create or increase significant natural hazard risk for other people, places and values, land use plans and natural environment plans must ensure activities, including any associated mitigation measures, that create or increase significant natural hazard risk on other land uses and public values, avoid or mitigate that risk using an approach that is proportionate to the level of risk."]
  [13796 :block/updated-at 1792298898800]
  [13796 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f57-bd56-45fc-99ee-a3d01fc5aab6"]
  [13797 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13797 :block/order "a8"]
  [13797 :block/page 13771]
  [13797 :block/parent 13792]
  [13797 :block/title ""]
  [13797 :block/updated-at 1792298839891]
  [13797 :block/uuid #uuid "6ad44f57-e7a7-44b3-abab-103325848958"]
  [13798 :block/created-at 1792298839891]
  [13798 :block/order "a9"]
